{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Sghe1aEqtD8R7GtyHh4VY7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t#ifndef INCLUDE_REMIMU\n2\t\n3\t/************\n4\t \n5\t    REMIMU: SINGLE HEADER C/C++ REGEX LIBRARY\n6\t\n7\t    Compatible with C99 and C++11 and later standards. Uses backtracking and relatively standard regex syntax.\n8\t\n9\t    #include \"my_regex.h\"\n10\t\n11\tFUNCTIONS\n12\t\n13\t    // Returns 0 on success, or -1 on invalid or unsupported regex, or -2 on not enough tokens given to parse regex.\n14\t    static inline int regex_parse(\n15\t        const char * pattern,       // Regex pattern to parse.\n16\t        RegexToken * tokens,        // Output buffer of token_count regex tokens.\n17\t        int16_t * token_count,      // Maximum allowed number of tokens to write\n18\t        int32_t flags               // Optional bitflags.\n19\t    )\n20\t    \n21\t    // Returns match length, or -1 on no match, or -2 on out of memory, or -3 if the regex is invalid.\n22\t    static inline int64_t regex_match(\n23\t        const RegexToken * tokens,  // Parsed regex to match against text.\n24\t        const char * text,          // Text to match against tokens.\n25\t        size_t start_i,             // index value to match at.\n26\t        uint16_t cap_slots,         // Number of allowed capture info output slots.\n27\t        int64_t * cap_pos,          // Capture position info output buffer.\n28\t        int64_t * cap_span          // Capture length info output buffer.\n29\t    ) \n30\t    \n31\t    static inline void print_regex_tokens(\n32\t        RegexToken * tokens     // Regex tokens to spew to stdout, for debugging.\n33\t    )\n34\t\n35\tPERFORMANCE\n36\t\n37\t    On simple cases, Remimu's match speed is similar to PCRE2. Regex parsing/compilation is also much faster (around 4x to 10x), so single-shot regexes are often faster than PCRE2.\n38\t\n39\t    HOWEVER: Remimu is a pure backtracking engine, and has `O(2^x)` complexity on regexes with catastrophic backtracking. It can be much, much, MUCH slower than PCRE2. Beware!\n40\t\n41\t    Remimu uses length-checked fixed memory buffers with no recursion, so memory usage is statically known.\n42\t\n43\tFEATURES\n44\t\n45\t    - Lowest-common-denominator common regex syntax\n46\t    - Based on backtracking (slow in the worst case, but fast in the best case)\n47\t    - 8-bit only, not unicode\n48\t    - Statically known memory usage (no heap allocation or recursion)\n49\t    - Groups with or without capture, and with or without quantifiers\n50\t    - Supported escapes:\n51\t    - - 2-digit hex: e.g. \\x00, \\xFF, or lowercase, or mixed case\n52\t    - - \\r, \\n, \\t, \\v, \\f (whitespace characters)\n53\t    - - \\d, \\s, \\w, \\D, \\S, \\W (digit, space, and word character classes)\n54\t    - - \\b, \\B word boundary and non-word-boundary anchors (not fully supported in zero-size quantified groups, but even then, usually supported)\n55\t    - - Escaped literal characters: {}[]-()|^$*+?:./\\\n56\t    - - - Escapes work in character classes, except for 'b'\n57\t    - Character classes, including disjoint ranges, proper handling of bare [ and trailing -, etc\n58\t    - - Dot (.) matches all characters, including newlines, unless REMIMU_FLAG_DOT_NO_NEWLINES is passed as a flag to regex_parse\n59\t    - - Dot (.) only matches at most one byte at a time, so matching \\r\\n requires two dots (and not using REMIMU_FLAG_DOT_NO_NEWLINES)\n60\t    - Anchors (^ and $)\n61\t    - - Same support caveats as \\b, \\B apply\n62\t    - Basic quantifiers (*, +, ?)\n63\t    - - Quantifiers are greedy by default.\n64\t    - Explicit quantifiers ({2}, {5}, {5,}, {5,7})\n65\t    - Alternation e.g. (asdf|foo)\n66\t    - Lazy quantifiers e.g. (asdf)*? or \\w+?\n67\t    - Possessive greedy quantifiers e.g. (asdf)*+ or \\w++\n68\t    - - NOTE: Capture groups for and inside of possessive groups return no capture information.\n69\t    - Atomic groups e.g. (?>(asdf))\n70\t    - - NOTE: Capture groups inside of atomic groups return no capture information.\n71\t\n72\tNOT SUPPORTED\n73\t\n74\t    - Strings with non-terminal null characters\n75\t    - Unicode, unicode character classes, etc\n76\t    - Exact POSIX regex semantics (posix-style greediness etc)\n77\t    - Backreferences\n78\t    - Lookbehind/Lookahead\n79\t    - Named groups\n80\t    - Most other weird flavor-specific regex stuff\n81\t    - Capture of or inside of possessive-quantified groups (still take up a capture slot, but no data is returned)\n82\t\n83\tUSAGE\n84\t\n85\t    // minimal:\n86\t    \n87\t    RegexToken tokens[1024];\n88\t    int16_t token_count = 1024;\n89\t    int e = regex_parse(\"[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+\", tokens, &token_count, 0);\n90\t    assert(!e);\n91\t    \n92\t    int64_t match_len = regex_match(tokens, \"23.53) \", 0, 0, 0, 0);\n93\t    printf(\"########### return: %zd\\n\", match_len);\n94\t    \n95\t    // with captures:\n96\t    \n97\t    RegexToken tokens[256];\n98\t    int16_t token_count = sizeof(tokens)/sizeof(tokens[0]);\n99\t    int e = regex_parse(\"((a)|(b))++\", tokens, &token_count, 0);\n100\t    assert(!e);\n101\t    \n102\t    int64_t cap_pos[5];\n103\t    int64_t cap_span[5];\n104\t    memset(cap_pos, 0xFF, sizeof(cap_pos));\n105\t    memset(cap_span, 0xFF, sizeof(cap_span));\n106\t    \n107\t    int64_t matchlen = regex_match(tokens, \"aaaaaabbbabaqa\", 0, 5, cap_pos, cap_span);\n108\t    printf(\"Match length: %zd\\n\", matchlen);\n109\t    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++)\n110\t        printf(\"Capture %d: %zd plus %zd\\n\", i, cap_pos[i], cap_span[i]);\n111\t    \n112\t    // for debugging\n113\t    print_regex_tokens(tokens);\n114\t\n115\tLICENSE\n116\t\n117\t    Creative Commons Zero, public domain.\n118\t\n119\t*/\n120\t\n121\t#include <stdint.h>\n122\t#include <stdio.h>\n123\t#include <stddef.h>\n124\t#include <string.h>\n125\t#include <assert.h>\n126\t\n127\tstatic const int REMIMU_FLAG_DOT_NO_NEWLINES = 1;\n128\t\n129\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_NORMAL      = 0;\n130\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_OPEN        = 1;\n131\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN      = 2;\n132\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE       = 3;\n133\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_OR          = 4;\n134\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_CARET       = 5;\n135\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_DOLLAR      = 6;\n136\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_BOUND       = 7;\n137\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_NBOUND      = 8;\n138\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_END         = 9;\n139\t\n140\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE  = 1;\n141\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_MODE_LAZY        = 2;\n142\tstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_MODE_INVERTED    = 128; // temporary; gets cleared later\n143\t\n144\ttypedef struct _RegexToken {\n145\t    uint8_t kind;\n146\t    uint8_t mode;\n147\t    uint16_t count_lo;\n148\t    uint16_t count_hi; // 0 means no limit\n149\t    uint16_t mask[16]; // for groups: mask 0 stores group-with-quantifier number (quantifiers are +, *, ?, {n}, {n,}, or {n,m})\n150\t    int16_t pair_offset; // from ( or ), offset in token list to matching paren. TODO: move into mask maybe\n151\t} RegexToken;\n152\t\n153\t/// Returns a negative number on failure:\n154\t/// -1: Regex string is invalid or using unsupported features or too long.\n155\t/// -2: Provided buffer not long enough. Give up, or reallocate with more length and retry.\n156\t/// Returns 0 on success.\n157\t/// On call, token_count pointer must point to the number of tokens that can be written to the tokens buffer.\n158\t/// On successful return, the number of actually used tokens is written to token_count.\n159\t/// Sets token_count to zero if a regex is not created but no error happened (e.g. empty pattern).\n160\t/// Flags: Not yet used.\n161\t/// SAFETY: Pattern must be null-terminated.\n162\t/// SAFETY: tokens buffer must have at least the input token_count number of RegexToken objects. They are allowed to be uninitialized.\n163\tstatic inline int regex_parse(const char * pattern, RegexToken * tokens, int16_t * token_count, int32_t flags)\n164\t{\n165\t    int64_t tokens_len = *token_count;\n166\t    uint64_t pattern_len = strlen(pattern);\n167\t    if (token_count == 0)\n168\t        return -2;\n169\t    \n170\t    // 0: normal\n171\t    // 1: just saw a backslash\n172\t    int esc_state = 0;\n173\t    \n174\t    // 0: init\n175\t    // 1: normal\n176\t    // 2: in char class, initial state\n177\t    // 3: in char class, but possibly looking for a range marker\n178\t    // 4: in char class, but just saw a range marker\n179\t    // 5: immediately after quantifiable token\n180\t    // 6: immediately after quantifier\n181\t    \n182\t    const int STATE_NORMAL    = 1;\n183\t    const int STATE_QUANT     = 2;\n184\t    const int STATE_MODE      = 3;\n185\t    const int STATE_CC_INIT   = 4;\n186\t    const int STATE_CC_NORMAL = 5;\n187\t    const int STATE_CC_RANGE  = 6;\n188\t    int state = STATE_NORMAL;\n189\t    \n190\t    int char_class_mem = -1;\n191\t    \n192\t    RegexToken token;\n193\t    #define _REGEX_CLEAR_TOKEN(TOKEN) { memset(&(TOKEN), 0, sizeof(RegexToken)); token.count_lo = 1; token.count_hi = 2; }\n194\t    _REGEX_CLEAR_TOKEN(token);\n195\t    \n196\t    #define _REGEX_DO_INVERT() { \\\n197\t        for (int n = 0; n < 16; n++) \\\n198\t            token.mask[n] = ~token.mask[n]; \\\n199\t        token.mode &= ~REMIMU_MODE_INVERTED; \\\n200\t    }\n201\t    \n202\t    int16_t k = 0;\n203\t    \n204\t    #define _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN() { \\\n205\t        if (k == 0 || tokens[k-1].kind != token.kind || (token.kind != REMIMU_KIND_BOUND && token.kind != REMIMU_KIND_NBOUND)) \\\n206\t        { \\\n207\t            if (token.mode & REMIMU_MODE_INVERTED) _REGEX_DO_INVERT() \\\n208\t            if (k >= tokens_len) \\\n209\t            { \\\n210\t                puts(\"buffer overflow\"); \\\n211\t                return -2; \\\n212\t            } \\\n213\t            tokens[k++] = token; \\\n214\t            _REGEX_CLEAR_TOKEN(token); \\\n215\t        } \\\n216\t    }\n217\t    \n218\t    #define _REGEX_SET_MASK(byte) { token.mask[((uint8_t)(byte))>>4] |= 1 << ((uint8_t)(byte) & 0xF); }\n219\t    #define _REGEX_SET_MASK_ALL() { \\\n220\t        for (int n = 0; n < 16; n++) \\\n221\t            token.mask[n] = 0xFFFF; \\\n222\t    }\n223\t    \n224\t    // start with an invisible group specifier\n225\t    // (this allows the matcher to not need to have a special root-level alternation operator case)\n226\t    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_OPEN;\n227\t    token.count_lo = 0;\n228\t    token.count_hi = 0;\n229\t\n230\t    int paren_count = 0;\n231\t    \n232\t    for (uint64_t i = 0; i < pattern_len; i++)\n233\t    {\n234\t        char c = pattern[i];\n235\t        if (state == STATE_QUANT)\n236\t        {\n237\t            state = STATE_MODE;\n238\t            if (c == '?')\n239\t            {\n240\t                token.count_lo = 0;\n241\t                token.count_hi = 2; // first non-allowed amount\n242\t                continue;\n243\t            }\n244\t            else if (c == '+')\n245\t            {\n246\t                token.count_lo = 1;\n247\t                token.count_hi = 0; // unlimited\n248\t                continue;\n249\t            }\n250\t            else if (c == '*')\n251\t            {\n252\t                token.count_lo = 0;\n253\t                token.count_hi = 0; // unlimited\n254\t                continue;\n255\t            }\n256\t            else if (c == '{')\n257\t            {\n258\t                if (pattern[i+1] == 0 || pattern[i+1] < '0' || pattern[i+1] > '9')\n259\t                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n260\t                else\n261\t                {\n262\t                    i += 1;\n263\t                    uint32_t val = 0;\n264\t                    while (pattern[i] >= '0' && pattern[i] <= '9')\n265\t                    {\n266\t                        val *= 10;\n267\t                        val += (uint32_t)(pattern[i] - '0');\n268\t                        if (val > 0xFFFF)\n269\t                        {\n270\t                            puts(\"quantifier range too long\");\n271\t                            return -1; // unsupported length\n272\t                        }\n273\t                        i += 1;\n274\t                    }\n275\t                    token.count_lo = val;\n276\t                    token.count_hi = val + 1;\n277\t                    if (pattern[i] == ',')\n278\t                    {\n279\t                        token.count_hi = 0; // unlimited\n280\t                        i += 1;\n281\t                        \n282\t                        if (pattern[i] >= '0' && pattern[i] <= '9')\n283\t                        {\n284\t                            uint32_t val2 = 0;\n285\t                            while (pattern[i] >= '0' && pattern[i] <= '9')\n286\t                            {\n287\t                                val2 *= 10;\n288\t                                val2 += (uint32_t)(pattern[i] - '0');\n289\t                                if (val2 > 0xFFFF)\n290\t                                {\n291\t                                    puts(\"quantifier range too long\");\n292\t                                    return -1; // unsupported length\n293\t                                }\n294\t                                i += 1;\n295\t                            }\n296\t                            if (val2 < val)\n297\t                            {\n298\t                                puts(\"quantifier range is backwards\");\n299\t                                return -1; // unsupported length\n300\t                            }\n301\t                            token.count_hi = val2 + 1;\n302\t                        }\n303\t                    }\n304\t                    \n305\t                    if (pattern[i] == '}')\n306\t                    {\n307\t                        // quantifier range parsed successfully\n308\t                        continue;\n309\t                    }\n310\t                    else\n311\t                    {\n312\t                        puts(\"quantifier range syntax broken (no terminator)\");\n313\t                        return -1;\n314\t                    }\n315\t                }\n316\t            }\n317\t        }\n318\t        \n319\t        if (state == STATE_MODE)\n320\t        {\n321\t            state = STATE_NORMAL;\n322\t            if (c == '?')\n323\t            {\n324\t                token.mode |= REMIMU_MODE_LAZY;\n325\t                continue;\n326\t            }\n327\t            else if (c == '+')\n328\t            {\n329\t                token.mode |= REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE;\n330\t                continue;\n331\t            }\n332\t        }\n333\t        \n334\t        if (state == STATE_NORMAL)\n335\t        {\n336\t            if (esc_state == 1)\n337\t            {\n338\t                esc_state = 0;\n339\t                if (c == 'n')\n340\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\n')\n341\t                else if (c == 'r')\n342\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\r')\n343\t                else if (c == 't')\n344\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\t')\n345\t                else if (c == 'v')\n346\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\v')\n347\t                else if (c == 'f')\n348\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\f')\n349\t                else if (c == 'x')\n350\t                {\n351\t                    if (pattern[i+1] == 0 || pattern[i+2] == 0)\n352\t                        return -1; // too-short hex pattern\n353\t                    uint8_t n0 = pattern[i+1];\n354\t                    uint8_t n1 = pattern[i+1];\n355\t                    if (n0 < '0' || n0 > 'f' || n1 < '0' || n1 > 'f' ||\n356\t                        (n0 > '9' && n0 < 'A') || (n1 > '9' && n1 < 'A'))\n357\t                        return -1; // invalid hex digit\n358\t                    if (n0 > 'F') n0 -= 0x20;\n359\t                    if (n1 > 'F') n1 -= 0x20;\n360\t                    if (n0 >= 'A') n0 -= 'A' - 10;\n361\t                    if (n1 >= 'A') n1 -= 'A' - 10;\n362\t                    n0 -= '0';\n363\t                    n1 -= '0';\n364\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK((n1 << 4) | n0)\n365\t                    i += 2;\n366\t                }\n367\t                else if (c == '{' || c == '}' ||\n368\t                         c == '[' || c == ']' || c == '-' ||\n369\t                         c == '(' || c == ')' ||\n370\t                         c == '|' || c == '^' || c == '$' ||\n371\t                         c == '*' || c == '+' || c == '?' || c == ':' ||\n372\t                         c == '.' || c == '/' || c == '\\\\')\n373\t                {\n374\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK(c)\n375\t                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n376\t                }\n377\t                else if (c == 'd' || c == 's' || c == 'w' ||\n378\t                         c == 'D' || c == 'S' || c == 'W')\n379\t                {\n380\t                    uint8_t is_upper = c <= 'Z';\n381\t                    \n382\t                    uint16_t m[16];\n383\t                    memset(m, 0, sizeof(m));\n384\t                    \n385\t                    if (is_upper)\n386\t                        c += 0x20;\n387\t                    if (c == 'd' || c == 'w')\n388\t                        m[3] |= 0x03FF; // 0~7\n389\t                    if (c == 's')\n390\t                    {\n391\t                        m[0] |= 0x3E00; // \\t-\\r (includes \\n, \\v, and \\f in the middle. 5 enabled bits.)\n392\t                        m[2] |= 1; // ' '\n393\t                    }\n394\t                    if (c == 'w')\n395\t                    {\n396\t                        m[4] |= 0xFFFE; // A-O\n397\t                        m[5] |= 0x87FF; // P-Z_\n398\t                        m[6] |= 0xFFFE; // a-o\n399\t                        m[7] |= 0x07FF; // p-z\n400\t                    }\n401\t                    \n402\t                    for (int i = 0; i < 16; i++)\n403\t                        token.mask[i] |= is_upper ? ~m[i] : m[i];\n404\t                    \n405\t                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NORMAL;\n406\t                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n407\t                }\n408\t                else if (c == 'b')\n409\t                {\n410\t                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_BOUND;\n411\t                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n412\t                }\n413\t                else if (c == 'B')\n414\t                {\n415\t                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NBOUND;\n416\t                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n417\t                }\n418\t                else\n419\t                {\n420\t                    puts(\"unsupported escape sequence\");\n421\t                    return -1; // unknown/unsupported escape sequence\n422\t                }\n423\t            }\n424\t            else\n425\t            {\n426\t                _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN()\n427\t                if (c == '\\\\')\n428\t                {\n429\t                    esc_state = 1;\n430\t                }\n431\t                else if (c == '[')\n432\t                {\n433\t                    state = STATE_CC_INIT;\n434\t                    char_class_mem = -1;\n435\t                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NORMAL;\n436\t                    if (pattern[i + 1] == '^')\n437\t                    {\n438\t                        token.mode |= REMIMU_MODE_INVERTED;\n439\t                        i += 1;\n440\t                    }\n441\t                }\n442\t                else if (c == '(')\n443\t                {\n444\t                    paren_count += 1;\n445\t                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n446\t                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_OPEN;\n447\t                    token.count_lo = 0;\n448\t                    token.count_hi = 1;\n449\t                    if (pattern[i + 1] == '?' && pattern[i + 2] == ':')\n450\t                    {\n451\t                        token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN;\n452\t                        i += 2;\n453\t                    }\n454\t                    else if (pattern[i + 1] == '?' && pattern[i + 2] == '>')\n455\t                    {\n456\t                        token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN;\n457\t                        _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN()\n458\t                        \n459\t                        state = STATE_NORMAL;\n460\t                        token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN;\n461\t                        token.mode = REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE;\n462\t                        token.count_lo = 1;\n463\t                        token.count_hi = 2;\n464\t                        \n465\t                        i += 2;\n466\t                    }\n467\t                }\n468\t                else if (c == ')')\n469\t                {\n470\t                    paren_count -= 1;\n471\t                    if (paren_count < 0 || k == 0)\n472\t                        return -1; // unbalanced parens\n473\t                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE;\n474\t                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n475\t                    \n476\t                    int balance = 0;\n477\t                    ptrdiff_t found = -1;\n478\t                    for (ptrdiff_t l = k - 1; l >= 0; l--)\n479\t                    {\n480\t                        if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN || tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN)\n481\t                        {\n482\t                            if (balance == 0)\n483\t                            {\n484\t                                found = l;\n485\t                                break;\n486\t                            }\n487\t                            else\n488\t                                balance -= 1;\n489\t                        }\n490\t                        else if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n491\t                            balance += 1;\n492\t                    }\n493\t                    if (found == -1)\n494\t                        return -1; // unbalanced parens\n495\t                    ptrdiff_t diff = k - found;\n496\t                    if (diff > 32767)\n497\t                        return -1; // too long\n498\t                    token.pair_offset = -diff;\n499\t                    tokens[found].pair_offset = diff;\n500\t                    // phantom group for atomic group emulation\n501\t                    if (tokens[found].mode == REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE)\n502\t                    {\n503\t                        _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN()\n504\t                        token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE;\n505\t                        token.mode = REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE;\n506\t                        token.pair_offset = -diff - 2;\n507\t                        tokens[found - 1].pair_offset = diff + 2;\n508\t                    }\n509\t                }\n510\t                else if (c == '?' || c == '+' || c == '*' || c == '{')\n511\t                {\n512\t                    puts(\"quantifier in non-quantifier context\");\n513\t                    return -1; // quantifier in non-quantifier context\n514\t                }\n515\t                else if (c == '.')\n516\t                {\n517\t                    //puts(\"setting ALL of mask...\");\n518\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK_ALL();\n519\t                    if (flags & REMIMU_FLAG_DOT_NO_NEWLINES)\n520\t                    {\n521\t                        token.mask[1] ^= 0x04; // \\n\n522\t                        token.mask[1] ^= 0x20; // \\r\n523\t                    }\n524\t                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n525\t                }\n526\t                else if (c == '^')\n527\t                {\n528\t                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_CARET;\n529\t                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n530\t                }\n531\t                else if (c == '$')\n532\t                {\n533\t                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_DOLLAR;\n534\t                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n535\t                }\n536\t                else if (c == '|')\n537\t                {\n538\t                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_OR;\n539\t                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n540\t                }\n541\t                else\n542\t                {\n543\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK(c);\n544\t                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n545\t                }\n546\t            }\n547\t        }\n548\t        else if (state == STATE_CC_INIT || state == STATE_CC_NORMAL || state == STATE_CC_RANGE)\n549\t        {\n550\t            if (c == '\\\\' && esc_state == 0)\n551\t            {\n552\t                esc_state = 1;\n553\t                continue;\n554\t            }\n555\t            uint8_t esc_c = 0;\n556\t            if (esc_state == 1)\n557\t            {\n558\t                esc_state = 0;\n559\t                if (c == 'n')\n560\t                    esc_c = '\\n';\n561\t                else if (c == 'r')\n562\t                    esc_c = '\\r';\n563\t                else if (c == 't')\n564\t                    esc_c = '\\t';\n565\t                else if (c == 'v')\n566\t                    esc_c = '\\v';\n567\t                else if (c == 'f')\n568\t                    esc_c = '\\f';\n569\t                else if (c == 'x')\n570\t                {\n571\t                    if (pattern[i+1] == 0 || pattern[i+2] == 0)\n572\t                        return -1; // too-short hex pattern\n573\t                    uint8_t n0 = pattern[i+1];\n574\t                    uint8_t n1 = pattern[i+1];\n575\t                    if (n0 < '0' || n0 > 'f' || n1 < '0' || n1 > 'f' ||\n576\t                        (n0 > '9' && n0 < 'A') || (n1 > '9' && n1 < 'A'))\n577\t                        return -1; // invalid hex digit\n578\t                    if (n0 > 'F') n0 -= 0x20;\n579\t                    if (n1 > 'F') n1 -= 0x20;\n580\t                    if (n0 >= 'A') n0 -= 'A' - 10;\n581\t                    if (n1 >= 'A') n1 -= 'A' - 10;\n582\t                    n0 -= '0';\n583\t                    n1 -= '0';\n584\t                    esc_c = (n1 << 4) | n0;\n585\t                    i += 2;\n586\t                }\n587\t                else if (c == '{' || c == '}' ||\n588\t                         c == '[' || c == ']' || c == '-' ||\n589\t                         c == '(' || c == ')' ||\n590\t                         c == '|' || c == '^' || c == '$' ||\n591\t                         c == '*' || c == '+' || c == '?' || c == ':' ||\n592\t                         c == '.' || c == '/' || c == '\\\\')\n593\t                {\n594\t                    esc_c = c;\n595\t                }\n596\t                else if (c == 'd' || c == 's' || c == 'w' ||\n597\t                         c == 'D' || c == 'S' || c == 'W')\n598\t                {\n599\t                    if (state == STATE_CC_RANGE)\n600\t                    {\n601\t                        puts(\"tried to use a shorthand as part of a range\");\n602\t                        return -1; // range shorthands can't be part of a range\n603\t                    }\n604\t                    uint8_t is_upper = c <= 'Z';\n605\t                    \n606\t                    uint16_t m[16];\n607\t                    memset(m, 0, sizeof(m));\n608\t                    \n609\t                    if (is_upper)\n610\t                        c += 0x20;\n611\t                    if (c == 'd' || c == 'w')\n612\t                        m[3] |= 0x03FF; // 0~7\n613\t                    if (c == 's')\n614\t                    {\n615\t                        m[0] |= 0x3E00; // \\t-\\r (includes \\n, \\v, and \\f in the middle. 5 enabled bits.)\n616\t                        m[2] |= 1; // ' '\n617\t                    }\n618\t                    if (c == 'w')\n619\t                    {\n620\t                        m[4] |= 0xFFFE; // A-O\n621\t                        m[5] |= 0x87FF; // P-Z_\n622\t                        m[6] |= 0xFFFE; // a-o\n623\t                        m[7] |= 0x07FF; // p-z\n624\t                    }\n625\t                    \n626\t                    for (int i = 0; i < 16; i++)\n627\t                        token.mask[i] |= is_upper ? ~m[i] : m[i];\n628\t                    \n629\t                    char_class_mem = -1; // range shorthands can't be part of a range\n630\t                    continue;\n631\t                }\n632\t                else\n633\t                {\n634\t                    printf(\"unknown/unsupported escape sequence in character class (\\\\%c)\\n\", c);\n635\t                    return -1; // unknown/unsupported escape sequence\n636\t                }\n637\t            }\n638\t            if (state == STATE_CC_INIT)\n639\t            {\n640\t                char_class_mem = c;\n641\t                _REGEX_SET_MASK(c);\n642\t                state = STATE_CC_NORMAL;\n643\t            }\n644\t            else if (state == STATE_CC_NORMAL)\n645\t            {\n646\t                if (c == ']' && esc_c == 0)\n647\t                {\n648\t                    char_class_mem = -1;\n649\t                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n650\t                    continue;\n651\t                }\n652\t                else if (c == '-' && esc_c == 0 && char_class_mem >= 0)\n653\t                {\n654\t                    state = STATE_CC_RANGE;\n655\t                    continue;\n656\t                }\n657\t                else\n658\t                {\n659\t                    char_class_mem = c;\n660\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK(c);\n661\t                    state = STATE_CC_NORMAL;\n662\t                }\n663\t            }\n664\t            else if (state == STATE_CC_RANGE)\n665\t            {\n666\t                if (c == ']' && esc_c == 0)\n667\t                {\n668\t                    char_class_mem = -1;\n669\t                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('-');\n670\t                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n671\t                    continue;\n672\t                }\n673\t                else\n674\t                {\n675\t                    if (char_class_mem == -1)\n676\t                    {\n677\t                        puts(\"character class range is broken\");\n678\t                        return -1; // probably tried to use a character class shorthand as part of a range\n679\t                    }\n680\t                    if ((uint8_t)c < char_class_mem)\n681\t                    {\n682\t                        puts(\"character class range is misordered\");\n683\t                        return -1; // range is in wrong order\n684\t                    }\n685\t                    //printf(\"enabling char class from %d to %d...\\n\", char_class_mem, c);\n686\t                    for (uint8_t i = c; i > char_class_mem; i--)\n687\t                        _REGEX_SET_MASK(i);\n688\t                    state = STATE_CC_NORMAL;\n689\t                    char_class_mem = -1;\n690\t                }\n691\t            }\n692\t        }\n693\t        else\n694\t            assert(0);\n695\t    }\n696\t    if (paren_count > 0)\n697\t    {\n698\t        puts(\"(paren_count > 0)\");\n699\t        return -1; // unbalanced parens\n700\t    }\n701\t    if (esc_state != 0)\n702\t    {\n703\t        puts(\"(esc_state != 0)\");\n704\t        return -1; // open escape sequence\n705\t    }\n706\t    if (state >= STATE_CC_INIT)\n707\t    {\n708\t        puts(\"(state >= STATE_CC_INIT)\");\n709\t        return -1; // open character class\n710\t    }\n711\t    \n712\t    _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN()\n713\t    \n714\t    // add invisible non-capturing group specifier\n715\t    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE;\n716\t    token.count_lo = 1;\n717\t    token.count_hi = 2;\n718\t    _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN();\n719\t    \n720\t    // add end token (tells matcher that it's done)\n721\t    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_END;\n722\t    _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN();\n723\t    \n724\t    tokens[0].pair_offset = k - 2;\n725\t    tokens[k-2].pair_offset = -(k - 2);\n726\t    \n727\t    *token_count = k;\n728\t    \n729\t    // copy quantifiers from )s to (s (so (s know whether they're optional)\n730\t    // also take the opportunity to smuggle \"quantified group index\" into the mask field for the )\n731\t    uint64_t n = 0;\n732\t    for (int16_t k2 = 0; k2 < k; k2++)\n733\t    {\n734\t        if (tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n735\t        {\n736\t            tokens[k2].mask[0] = n++;\n737\t            \n738\t            int16_t k3 = k2 + tokens[k2].pair_offset;\n739\t            tokens[k3].count_lo = tokens[k2].count_lo;\n740\t            tokens[k3].count_hi = tokens[k2].count_hi;\n741\t            tokens[k3].mask[0] = n++;\n742\t            tokens[k3].mode = tokens[k2].mode;\n743\t            \n744\t            //if (n > 65535)\n745\t            if (n > 1024)\n746\t                return -1; // too many quantified groups\n747\t        }\n748\t        else if (tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR || tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n749\t        {\n750\t            // find next | or ) and how far away it is. store in token\n751\t            int balance = 0;\n752\t            ptrdiff_t found = -1;\n753\t            for (ptrdiff_t l = k2 + 1; l < tokens_len; l++)\n754\t            {\n755\t                if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR && balance == 0)\n756\t                {\n757\t                    found = l;\n758\t                    break;\n759\t                }\n760\t                else if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n761\t                {\n762\t                    if (balance == 0)\n763\t                    {\n764\t                        found = l;\n765\t                        break;\n766\t                    }\n767\t                    else\n768\t                        balance -= 1;\n769\t                }\n770\t                else if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN || tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN)\n771\t                    balance += 1;\n772\t            }\n773\t            if (found == -1)\n774\t            {\n775\t                puts(\"unbalanced parens...\");\n776\t                return -1; // unbalanced parens\n777\t            }\n778\t            ptrdiff_t diff = found - k2;\n779\t            if (diff > 32767)\n780\t            {\n781\t                puts(\"too long...\");\n782\t                return -1; // too long\n783\t            }\n784\t            \n785\t            if (tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR)\n786\t                tokens[k2].pair_offset = diff;\n787\t            else\n788\t                tokens[k2].mask[15] = diff;\n789\t        }\n790\t    }\n791\t    \n792\t    #undef _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN\n793\t    #undef _REGEX_SET_MASK\n794\t    #undef _REGEX_CLEAR_TOKEN\n795\t    \n796\t    return 0;\n797\t}\n798\t\n799\ttypedef struct _RegexMatcherState {\n800\t    uint32_t k;\n801\t    uint32_t group_state; // quantified group temp state (e.g. number of repetitions)\n802\t    uint32_t prev; // for )s, stack index of corresponding previous quantified state\n803\t#ifdef REGEX_STACK_SMOL\n804\t    uint32_t i;\n805\t    uint32_t range_min;\n806\t    uint32_t range_max;\n807\t#else\n808\t    uint64_t i;\n809\t    uint64_t range_min;\n810\t    uint64_t range_max;\n811\t#endif\n812\t} RegexMatcherState;\n813\t\n814\t// NOTE: undef'd later\n815\t#define _REGEX_CHECK_MASK(K, byte) (!!(tokens[K].mask[((uint8_t)byte)>>4] & (1 << ((uint8_t)byte & 0xF))))\n816\t\n817\t// Returns match length if text starts with a regex match.\n818\t// Returns -1 if the text doesn't start with a regex match.\n819\t// Returns -2 if the matcher ran out of memory or the regex is too complex.\n820\t// Returns -3 if the regex is somehow invalid.\n821\t// The first cap_slots capture positions and spans (lengths) will be written to cap_pos and cap_span. If zero, will not be written to.\n822\t// SAFETY: The text variable must be null-terminated, and start_i must be the index of a character within the string or its null terminator.\n823\t// SAFETY: Tokens array must be terminated by a REMIMU_KIND_END token (done by default by regex_parse).\n824\t// SAFETY: Partial capture data may be written even if the match fails.\n825\tstatic inline int64_t regex_match(const RegexToken * tokens, const char * text, size_t start_i, uint16_t cap_slots, int64_t * cap_pos, int64_t * cap_span)\n826\t{\n827\t    (void)text;\n828\t    \n829\t#ifdef REGEX_VERBOSE\n830\t    const uint8_t verbose = 1;\n831\t#else\n832\t    const uint8_t verbose = 0;\n833\t#endif\n834\t    \n835\t#define IF_VERBOSE(X) { if (verbose) { X } }\n836\t    \n837\t#ifdef REGEX_STACK_SMOL\n838\t    const uint16_t stack_size_max = 256;\n839\t#else\n840\t    const uint16_t stack_size_max = 1024;\n841\t#endif\n842\t    const uint16_t aux_stats_size = 1024;\n843\t    if (cap_slots > aux_stats_size)\n844\t        cap_slots = aux_stats_size;\n845\t    \n846\t    // quantified group state\n847\t    uint8_t q_group_accepts_zero[aux_stats_size];\n848\t    uint32_t q_group_state[aux_stats_size]; // number of repetitions\n849\t    uint32_t q_group_stack[aux_stats_size]; // location of most recent corresponding ) on stack. 0 means nowhere\n850\t    \n851\t    uint16_t q_group_cap_index[aux_stats_size];\n852\t    memset(q_group_cap_index, 0xFF, sizeof(q_group_cap_index));\n853\t    \n854\t    uint64_t tokens_len = 0;\n855\t    uint32_t k = 0;\n856\t    uint16_t caps = 0;\n857\t    \n858\t    while (tokens[k].kind != REMIMU_KIND_END)\n859\t    {\n860\t        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN && caps < cap_slots)\n861\t        {\n862\t            q_group_cap_index[tokens[k].mask[0]] = caps;\n863\t            q_group_cap_index[tokens[k + tokens[k].pair_offset].mask[0]] = caps;\n864\t            cap_pos[caps] = -1;\n865\t            cap_span[caps] = -1;\n866\t            caps += 1;\n867\t        }\n868\t        k += 1;\n869\t        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE || tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n870\t        {\n871\t            if (tokens[k].mask[0] >= aux_stats_size)\n872\t            {\n873\t                puts(\"too many qualified groups. returning\");\n874\t                return -2; // OOM: too many quantified groups\n875\t            }\n876\t            \n877\t            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n878\t            q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n879\t            q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n880\t        }\n881\t    }\n882\t    \n883\t    tokens_len = k;\n884\t    \n885\t    RegexMatcherState rewind_stack[stack_size_max];\n886\t    uint16_t stack_n = 0;\n887\t    \n888\t    uint64_t i = start_i;\n889\t    \n890\t    uint64_t range_min = 0;\n891\t    uint64_t range_max = 0;\n892\t    uint8_t just_rewinded = 0;\n893\t    \n894\t    #define _P_TEXT_HIGHLIGHTED() { \\\n895\t        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"\\033[91m\"); \\\n896\t        for (uint64_t q = 0; q < i; q++) printf(\"%c\", text[q]); \\\n897\t        printf(\"\\033[0m\"); \\\n898\t        for (uint64_t q = i; text[q] != 0; q++) printf(\"%c\", text[q]); \\\n899\t        printf(\"\\n\");) \\\n900\t    }\n901\t    \n902\t    #define _REWIND_DO_SAVE_RAW(K, ISDUMMY) { \\\n903\t        if (stack_n >= stack_size_max) \\\n904\t        { \\\n905\t            puts(\"out of backtracking room. returning\"); \\\n906\t            return -2; \\\n907\t        } \\\n908\t        RegexMatcherState s; \\\n909\t        memset(&s, 0, sizeof(RegexMatcherState)); \\\n910\t        s.i = i; \\\n911\t        s.k = (K); \\\n912\t        s.range_min = range_min; \\\n913\t        s.range_max = range_max; \\\n914\t        s.prev = 0; \\\n915\t        if (ISDUMMY) s.prev = 0xFAC7; \\\n916\t        else if (tokens[s.k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE) \\\n917\t        { \\\n918\t            s.group_state = q_group_state[tokens[s.k].mask[0]]; \\\n919\t            s.prev = q_group_stack[tokens[s.k].mask[0]]; \\\n920\t            q_group_stack[tokens[s.k].mask[0]] = stack_n; \\\n921\t        } \\\n922\t        rewind_stack[stack_n++] = s; \\\n923\t        _P_TEXT_HIGHLIGHTED() \\\n924\t        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"-- saving rewind state k %u i %zd rmin %zu rmax %zd (line %d) (depth %d prev %d)\\n\", s.k, i, range_min, range_max, __LINE__, stack_n, s.prev);) \\\n925\t    }\n926\t    #define _REWIND_DO_SAVE_DUMMY(K) _REWIND_DO_SAVE_RAW(K, 1)\n927\t    #define _REWIND_DO_SAVE(K) _REWIND_DO_SAVE_RAW(K, 0)\n928\t    \n929\t    #define _REWIND_OR_ABORT() { \\\n930\t        if (stack_n == 0) \\\n931\t            return -1; \\\n932\t        stack_n -= 1; \\\n933\t        while (stack_n > 0 && rewind_stack[stack_n].prev == 0xFAC7) stack_n -= 1; \\\n934\t        just_rewinded = 1; \\\n935\t        range_min = rewind_stack[stack_n].range_min; \\\n936\t        range_max = rewind_stack[stack_n].range_max; \\\n937\t        assert(rewind_stack[stack_n].i <= i); \\\n938\t        i = rewind_stack[stack_n].i; \\\n939\t        k = rewind_stack[stack_n].k; \\\n940\t        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE) \\\n941\t        { \\\n942\t            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = rewind_stack[stack_n].group_state; \\\n943\t            q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]] = rewind_stack[stack_n].prev; \\\n944\t        } \\\n945\t        _P_TEXT_HIGHLIGHTED() \\\n946\t        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"-- rewound to k %u i %zd rmin %zu rmax %zd (kind %d prev %d)\\n\", k, i, range_min, range_max, tokens[k].kind, rewind_stack[stack_n].prev);) \\\n947\t        k -= 1; \\\n948\t    }\n949\t    // the -= 1 is because of the k++ in the for loop\n950\t    \n951\t    // used in boundary anchor checker\n952\t    uint64_t w_mask[16];\n953\t    memset(w_mask, 0, sizeof(w_mask));\n954\t    w_mask[3] = 0x03FF;\n955\t    w_mask[4] = 0xFFFE;\n956\t    w_mask[5] = 0x87FF;\n957\t    w_mask[6] = 0xFFFE;\n958\t    w_mask[7] = 0x07FF;\n959\t    #define _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(byte) (!!(w_mask[((uint8_t)byte)>>4] & (1 << ((uint8_t)byte & 0xF))))\n960\t    \n961\t    size_t limit = 10000;\n962\t    for (k = 0; k < tokens_len; k++)\n963\t    {\n964\t        //limit--;\n965\t        if (limit == 0)\n966\t        {\n967\t            puts(\"iteration limit exceeded. returning\");\n968\t            return -2;\n969\t        }\n970\t        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"k: %u\\ti: %zu\\tl: %zu\\tstack_n: %d\\n\", k, i, limit, stack_n);)\n971\t        _P_TEXT_HIGHLIGHTED();\n972\t        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CARET)\n973\t        {\n974\t            if (i != 0)\n975\t                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n976\t            continue;\n977\t        }\n978\t        else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_DOLLAR)\n979\t        {\n980\t            if (text[i] != 0)\n981\t                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n982\t            continue;\n983\t        }\n984\t        else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_BOUND)\n985\t        {\n986\t            if (i == 0 && !_REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i]))\n987\t                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n988\t            else if (i != 0 && text[i] == 0 && !_REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i-1]))\n989\t                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n990\t            else if (i != 0 && text[i] != 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i-1]) == _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i]))\n991\t                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n992\t        }\n993\t        else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NBOUND)\n994\t        {\n995\t            if (i == 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i]))\n996\t                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n997\t            else if (i != 0 && text[i] == 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i-1]))\n998\t                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n999\t            else if (i != 0 && text[i] != 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i-1]) != _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i]))\n1000\t                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n1001\t        }\n1002\t        else\n1003\t        {\n1004\t            // deliberately unmatchable token (e.g. a{0}, a{0,0})\n1005\t            if (tokens[k].count_hi == 1)\n1006\t            {\n1007\t                if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n1008\t                    k += tokens[k].pair_offset;\n1009\t                else\n1010\t                    k += 1;\n1011\t                continue;\n1012\t            }\n1013\t            \n1014\t            if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n1015\t            {\n1016\t                if (!just_rewinded)\n1017\t                {\n1018\t                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"hit OPEN. i is %zd, depth is %d\\n\", i, stack_n);)\n1019\t                    // need this to be able to detect and reject zero-size matches\n1020\t                    //q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = i;\n1021\t                    \n1022\t                    // if we're lazy and the min length is 0, we need to try the non-group case first\n1023\t                    if ((tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY) && (tokens[k].count_lo == 0 || q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k + tokens[k].pair_offset].mask[0]]))\n1024\t                    {\n1025\t                        IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"trying non-group case first.....\");)\n1026\t                        range_min = 0;\n1027\t                        range_max = 0;\n1028\t                        _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n1029\t                        k += tokens[k].pair_offset; // automatic += 1 will put us past the matching )\n1030\t                    }\n1031\t                    else\n1032\t                    {\n1033\t                        range_min = 1;\n1034\t                        range_max = 0;\n1035\t                        _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n1036\t                    }\n1037\t                }\n1038\t                else\n1039\t                {\n1040\t                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"rewinded into OPEN. i is %zd, depth is %d\\n\", i, stack_n);)\n1041\t                    just_rewinded = 0;\n1042\t                    \n1043\t                    uint64_t orig_k = k;\n1044\t                    \n1045\t                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"--- trying to try another alternation, start k is %d, rmin is %zu\\n\", k, range_min);)\n1046\t                    \n1047\t                    if (range_min != 0)\n1048\t                    {\n1049\t                        IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"rangemin is not zero. checking...\");)\n1050\t                        k += range_min;\n1051\t                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"start kind: %d\\n\", tokens[k].kind);)\n1052\t                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"before start kind: %d\\n\", tokens[k-1].kind);)\n1053\t                        if (tokens[k-1].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR)\n1054\t                            k += tokens[k-1].pair_offset - 1;\n1055\t                        else if (tokens[k-1].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k-1].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n1056\t                            k += tokens[k-1].mask[15] - 1;\n1057\t                        \n1058\t                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"kamakama %d %d\\n\", k, tokens[k].kind);)\n1059\t                        \n1060\t                        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_END) // unbalanced parens\n1061\t                            return -3;\n1062\t                        \n1063\t                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"---?!?!   %d, %d\\n\", k, q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]]);)\n1064\t                        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n1065\t                        {\n1066\t                            IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"!!~!~!~~~~!!~~!~   hit CLOSE. rewinding\");)\n1067\t                            // do nothing and continue on if we don't need this group\n1068\t                            if (tokens[k].count_lo == 0 || q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]])\n1069\t                            {\n1070\t                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"continuing because we don't need this group\");)\n1071\t                                q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n1072\t                                \n1073\t                                if (!(tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY))\n1074\t                                    q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n1075\t                                \n1076\t                                continue;\n1077\t                            }\n1078\t                            // otherwise go to the last point before the group\n1079\t                            else\n1080\t                            {\n1081\t                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"going to last point before this group\");)\n1082\t                                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n1083\t                                continue;\n1084\t                            }\n1085\t                        }\n1086\t                        \n1087\t                        assert(tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR);\n1088\t                    }\n1089\t                    \n1090\t                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"--- FOUND ALTERNATION for paren at k %zd at k %d\\n\", orig_k, k);)\n1091\t                    \n1092\t                    ptrdiff_t k_diff = k - orig_k;\n1093\t                    range_min = k_diff + 1;\n1094\t                    \n1095\t                    IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"(saving in paren after rewinding and looking for next regex token to check)\");)\n1096\t                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"%zd\\n\", range_min);)\n1097\t                    _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k - k_diff)\n1098\t                }\n1099\t            }\n1100\t            else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n1101\t            {\n1102\t                // unquantified\n1103\t                if (tokens[k].count_lo == 1 && tokens[k].count_hi == 2)\n1104\t                {\n1105\t                    // for captures\n1106\t                    uint16_t cap_index = q_group_cap_index[tokens[k].mask[0]];\n1107\t                    if (cap_index != 0xFFFF)\n1108\t                        _REWIND_DO_SAVE_DUMMY(k)\n1109\t                }\n1110\t                // quantified\n1111\t                else\n1112\t                {\n1113\t                    IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"closer test.....\");)\n1114\t                    if (!just_rewinded)\n1115\t                    {\n1116\t                        uint32_t prev = q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]];\n1117\t                        \n1118\t                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"qrqrqrqrqrqrqrq-------      k %d, gs %d, gaz %d, i %zd, tklo %d, rmin %zd, tkhi %d, rmax %zd, prev %d, sn %d\\n\", k, q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]], i, tokens[k].count_lo, range_min, tokens[k].count_hi, range_max, prev, stack_n);)\n1119\t                        \n1120\t                        range_max = tokens[k].count_hi;\n1121\t                        range_max -= 1;\n1122\t                        range_min = q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]] ? 0 : tokens[k].count_lo;\n1123\t                        //assert(q_group_state[tokens[k + tokens[k].pair_offset].mask[0]] <= i);\n1124\t                        //if (prev) assert(rewind_stack[prev].i <= i);\n1125\t                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"qzqzqzqzqzqzqzq-------      rmin %zd, rmax %zd\\n\", range_min, range_max);)\n1126\t                        \n1127\t                        // minimum requirement not yet met\n1128\t                        if (q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] + 1 < range_min)\n1129\t                        {\n1130\t                            IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"continuing minimum matches for a quantified group\");)\n1131\t                            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] += 1;\n1132\t                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n1133\t                            \n1134\t                            k += tokens[k].pair_offset; // back to start of group\n1135\t                            k -= 1; // ensure we actually hit the group node next and not the node after it\n1136\t                            continue;\n1137\t                        }\n1138\t                        // maximum allowance exceeded\n1139\t                        else if (tokens[k].count_hi != 0 && q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] + 1 > range_max)\n1140\t                        {\n1141\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"hit maximum allowed instances of a quantified group %d %zd\\n\", q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], range_max);)\n1142\t                            range_max -= 1;\n1143\t                            _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n1144\t                            continue;\n1145\t                        }\n1146\t                        \n1147\t                        // fallback case to detect zero-length matches when we backtracked into the inside of this group\n1148\t                        // after an attempted parse of a second copy of itself\n1149\t                        uint8_t force_zero = 0;\n1150\t                        if (prev != 0 && (uint32_t)rewind_stack[prev].i > (uint32_t)i)\n1151\t                        {\n1152\t                            // find matching open paren\n1153\t                            size_t n = stack_n - 1;\n1154\t                            while (n > 0 && rewind_stack[n].k != k + tokens[k].pair_offset)\n1155\t                                n -= 1;\n1156\t                            assert(n > 0);\n1157\t                            if (rewind_stack[n].i == i)\n1158\t                                force_zero = 1;\n1159\t                        }\n1160\t                        \n1161\t                        // reject zero-length matches\n1162\t                        if ((force_zero || (prev != 0 && (uint32_t)rewind_stack[prev].i == (uint32_t)i))) //  && q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] > 0\n1163\t                        {\n1164\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"rejecting zero-length match..... %d %zd %zd\\n\", force_zero, rewind_stack[prev].i, i);)\n1165\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"%d (k: %d)\\n\", q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], k);)\n1166\t                            \n1167\t                            q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 1;\n1168\t                            _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n1169\t                            //range_max = q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]];\n1170\t                            //range_min = 0;\n1171\t                        }\n1172\t                        else if (tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY) // lazy\n1173\t                        {\n1174\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"nidnfasidfnidfndifn-------      %d, %d, %zd\\n\", q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], tokens[k].count_lo, range_min);)\n1175\t                            if (prev)\n1176\t                                IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"lazy doesn't think it's zero-length. prev i %zd vs i %zd (depth %d)\\n\", rewind_stack[prev].i, i, stack_n);)\n1177\t                            // continue on to past the group; group retry is in rewind state\n1178\t                            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] += 1;\n1179\t                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n1180\t                            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n1181\t                        }\n1182\t                        else // greedy\n1183\t                        {\n1184\t                            IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"wahiwahi\");)\n1185\t                            // clear unwanted memory if possessive\n1186\t                            if ((tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE))\n1187\t                            {\n1188\t                                uint32_t k2 = k;\n1189\t                                \n1190\t                                // special case for first, only rewind to (, not to )\n1191\t                                if (q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] == 0)\n1192\t                                    k2 = k + tokens[k].pair_offset;\n1193\t                                \n1194\t                                if (stack_n == 0)\n1195\t                                    return -1;\n1196\t                                stack_n -= 1;\n1197\t                                \n1198\t                                while (stack_n > 0 && rewind_stack[stack_n].k != k2)\n1199\t                                    stack_n -= 1;\n1200\t                                \n1201\t                                if (stack_n == 0)\n1202\t                                    return -1;\n1203\t                            }\n1204\t                            // continue to next match if sane\n1205\t                            if ((uint32_t)q_group_state[tokens[k + tokens[k].pair_offset].mask[0]] < (uint32_t)i)\n1206\t                            {\n1207\t                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"REWINDING FROM GREEDY NON-REWIND CLOSER\");)\n1208\t                                q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] += 1;\n1209\t                                _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n1210\t                                k += tokens[k].pair_offset; // back to start of group\n1211\t                                k -= 1; // ensure we actually hit the group node next and not the node after it\n1212\t                            }\n1213\t                            else\n1214\t                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"CONTINUING FROM GREEDY NON-REWIND CLOSER\");)\n1215\t                        }\n1216\t                    }\n1217\t                    else\n1218\t                    {\n1219\t                        IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"IN CLOSER REWIND!!!\");)\n1220\t                        just_rewinded = 0;\n1221\t                        \n1222\t                        if (tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY)\n1223\t                        {\n1224\t                            // lazy rewind: need to try matching the group again\n1225\t                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE_DUMMY(k)\n1226\t                            q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]] = stack_n;\n1227\t                            k += tokens[k].pair_offset; // back to start of group\n1228\t                            k -= 1; // ensure we actually hit the group node next and not the node after it\n1229\t                        }\n1230\t                        else\n1231\t                        {\n1232\t                            // greedy. if we're going to go outside the acceptable range, rewind\n1233\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"kufukufu %d %zd\\n\", tokens[k].count_lo, range_min);)\n1234\t                            //uint64_t old_i = i;\n1235\t                            if (q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] < range_min && !q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]])\n1236\t                            {\n1237\t                                IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"rewinding from greedy group because we're going to go out of range (%d vs %zd)\\n\", q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], range_min);)\n1238\t                                //i = old_i;\n1239\t                                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n1240\t                            }\n1241\t                            // otherwise continue on to past the group\n1242\t                            else\n1243\t                            {\n1244\t                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"continuing past greedy group\");)\n1245\t                                q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n1246\t                                \n1247\t                                // for captures\n1248\t                                uint16_t cap_index = q_group_cap_index[tokens[k].mask[0]];\n1249\t                                if (cap_index != 0xFFFF)\n1250\t                                    _REWIND_DO_SAVE_DUMMY(k)\n1251\t                            }\n1252\t                        }\n1253\t                    }\n1254\t                }\n1255\t            }\n1256\t            else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR)\n1257\t            {\n1258\t                IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"hit OR at %d. adding %d\\n\", k, tokens[k].pair_offset);)\n1259\t                k += tokens[k].pair_offset;\n1260\t                k -= 1;\n1261\t            }\n1262\t            else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NORMAL)\n1263\t            {\n1264\t                if (!just_rewinded)\n1265\t                {\n1266\t                    uint64_t n = 0;\n1267\t                    // do whatever the obligatory minimum amount of matching is\n1268\t                    uint64_t old_i = i;\n1269\t                    while (n < tokens[k].count_lo && text[i] != 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_MASK(k, text[i]))\n1270\t                    {\n1271\t                        i += 1;\n1272\t                        n += 1;\n1273\t                    }\n1274\t                    if (n < tokens[k].count_lo)\n1275\t                    {\n1276\t                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"non-match A. rewinding (token %d)\\n\", k);)\n1277\t                        i = old_i;\n1278\t                        _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n1279\t                        continue;\n1280\t                    }\n1281\t                    \n1282\t                    if (tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY)\n1283\t                    {\n1284\t                        range_min = n;\n1285\t                        range_max = tokens[k].count_hi - 1;\n1286\t                        _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n1287\t                    }\n1288\t                    else\n1289\t                    {\n1290\t                        uint64_t limit = tokens[k].count_hi;\n1291\t                        if (limit == 0)\n1292\t                            limit = ~limit;\n1293\t                        range_min = n;\n1294\t                        while (text[i] != 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_MASK(k, text[i]) && n + 1 < limit)\n1295\t                        {\n1296\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"match!! (%c)\\n\", text[i]);)\n1297\t                            i += 1;\n1298\t                            n += 1;\n1299\t                        }\n1300\t                        range_max = n;\n1301\t                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"set rmin to %zd and rmax to %zd on entry into normal greedy token with k %d\\n\", range_min, range_max, k);)\n1302\t                        if (!(tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE))\n1303\t                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n1304\t                    }\n1305\t                }\n1306\t                else\n1307\t                {\n1308\t                    just_rewinded = 0;\n1309\t                    \n1310\t                    if (tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY)\n1311\t                    {\n1312\t                        uint64_t limit = range_max;\n1313\t                        if (limit == 0)\n1314\t                            limit = ~limit;\n1315\t                        \n1316\t                        if (_REGEX_CHECK_MASK(k, text[i]) && text[i] != 0 && range_min < limit)\n1317\t                        {\n1318\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"match2!! (%c) (k: %d)\\n\", text[i], k);)\n1319\t                            i += 1;\n1320\t                            range_min += 1;\n1321\t                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n1322\t                        }\n1323\t                        else\n1324\t                        {\n1325\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"core rewind lazy (k: %d)\\n\", k);)\n1326\t                            _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n1327\t                        }\n1328\t                    }\n1329\t                    else\n1330\t                    {\n1331\t                        //IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"comparing rmin %zd and rmax %zd token with k %d\\n\", range_min, range_max, k);)\n1332\t                        if (range_max > range_min)\n1333\t                        {\n1334\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"greedy normal going back (k: %d)\\n\", k);)\n1335\t                            i -= 1;\n1336\t                            range_max -= 1;\n1337\t                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n1338\t                        }\n1339\t                        else\n1340\t                        {\n1341\t                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"core rewind greedy (k: %d)\\n\", k);)\n1342\t                            _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n1343\t                        }\n1344\t                    }\n1345\t                }\n1346\t            }\n1347\t            else\n1348\t            {\n1349\t                fprintf(stderr, \"unimplemented token kind %d\\n\", tokens[k].kind);\n1350\t                assert(0);\n1351\t            }\n1352\t        }\n1353\t        //printf(\"k... %d\\n\", k);\n1354\t    }\n1355\t    \n1356\t    if (caps != 0)\n1357\t    {\n1358\t        //printf(\"stack_n: %d\\n\", stack_n);\n1359\t        fflush(stdout);\n1360\t        for (size_t n = 0; n < stack_n; n++)\n1361\t        {\n1362\t            RegexMatcherState s = rewind_stack[n];\n1363\t            int kind = tokens[s.k].kind;\n1364\t            if (kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n1365\t            {\n1366\t                uint16_t cap_index = q_group_cap_index[tokens[s.k].mask[0]];\n1367\t                if (cap_index == 0xFFFF)\n1368\t                    continue;\n1369\t                if (tokens[s.k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN)\n1370\t                    cap_pos[cap_index] = s.i;\n1371\t                else if (cap_pos[cap_index] >= 0)\n1372\t                    cap_span[cap_index] = s.i - cap_pos[cap_index];\n1373\t            }\n1374\t        }\n1375\t        // re-deinitialize capture positions that have no associated capture span\n1376\t        for (size_t n = 0; n < caps; n++)\n1377\t        {\n1378\t            if (cap_span[n] == -1)\n1379\t                cap_pos[n] = -1;\n1380\t        }\n1381\t    }\n1382\t    \n1383\t    #undef _REWIND_DO_SAVE\n1384\t    #undef _REWIND_OR_ABORT\n1385\t    #undef _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W\n1386\t    #undef _P_TEXT_HIGHLIGHTED\n1387\t    #undef IF_VERBOSE\n1388\t    \n1389\t    return i;\n1390\t}\n1391\t\n1392\tstatic inline void print_regex_tokens(RegexToken * tokens)\n1393\t{\n1394\t    const char * kind_to_str[] = {\n1395\t        \"NORMAL\",\n1396\t        \"OPEN\",\n1397\t        \"NCOPEN\",\n1398\t        \"CLOSE\",\n1399\t        \"OR\",\n1400\t        \"CARET\",\n1401\t        \"DOLLAR\",\n1402\t        \"BOUND\",\n1403\t        \"NBOUND\",\n1404\t        \"END\",\n1405\t    };\n1406\t    const char * mode_to_str[] = {\n1407\t        \"GREEDY\",\n1408\t        \"POSSESS\",\n1409\t        \"LAZY\",\n1410\t    };\n1411\t    for (int k = 0;; k++)\n1412\t    {\n1413\t        printf(\"%s\\t%s\\t\", kind_to_str[tokens[k].kind], mode_to_str[tokens[k].mode]);\n1414\t        \n1415\t        int c_old = -1;\n1416\t        for (int c = 0; c < (tokens[k].kind ? 0 : 256); c++)\n1417\t        {\n1418\t            #define _PRINT_C_SMART(c) { \\\n1419\t                if (c >= 0x20 && c <= 0x7E) \\\n1420\t                    printf(\"%c\", c); \\\n1421\t                else \\\n1422\t                    printf(\"\\\\x%02x\", c); \\\n1423\t            }\n1424\t                \n1425\t            if (_REGEX_CHECK_MASK(k, c))\n1426\t            {\n1427\t                if (c_old == -1)\n1428\t                    c_old = c;\n1429\t            }\n1430\t            else if (c_old != -1)\n1431\t            {\n1432\t                if (c - 1 == c_old)\n1433\t                {\n1434\t                    _PRINT_C_SMART(c_old)\n1435\t                    c_old = -1;\n1436\t                }\n1437\t                else if (c - 2 == c_old)\n1438\t                {\n1439\t                    _PRINT_C_SMART(c_old)\n1440\t                    _PRINT_C_SMART(c_old + 1)\n1441\t                    c_old = -1;\n1442\t                }\n1443\t                else\n1444\t                {\n1445\t                    _PRINT_C_SMART(c_old)\n1446\t                    printf(\"-\");\n1447\t                    _PRINT_C_SMART(c - 1)\n1448\t                    c_old = -1;\n1449\t                }\n1450\t            }\n1451\t        }\n1452\t        \n1453\t        /*\n1454\t        printf(\"\\t\");\n1455\t        for (int i = 0; i < 16; i++)\n1456\t            printf(\"%04x\", tokens[k].mask[i]);\n1457\t        */\n1458\t        \n1459\t        printf(\"\\t{%d,%d}\\t(%d)\\n\", tokens[k].count_lo, tokens[k].count_hi - 1, tokens[k].pair_offset);\n1460\t        \n1461\t        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_END)\n1462\t            break;\n1463\t    }\n1464\t}\n1465\t\n1466\t#undef _REGEX_CHECK_MASK\n1467\t\n1468\t#endif //INCLUDE_REMIMU\n1469\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ccd944d-367b-4052-a0ad-bc5ea9b1730f","uuid":"fd532d61-69d1-473d-944f-36b71a07d186","timestamp":"2026-05-30T06:35:53.854Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/harvest-crust-GRV72v/project/c_src/my_regex.h","content":"#ifndef INCLUDE_REMIMU\n\n/************\n \n    REMIMU: SINGLE HEADER C/C++ REGEX LIBRARY\n\n    Compatible with C99 and C++11 and later standards. Uses backtracking and relatively standard regex syntax.\n\n    #include \"my_regex.h\"\n\nFUNCTIONS\n\n    // Returns 0 on success, or -1 on invalid or unsupported regex, or -2 on not enough tokens given to parse regex.\n    static inline int regex_parse(\n        const char * pattern,       // Regex pattern to parse.\n        RegexToken * tokens,        // Output buffer of token_count regex tokens.\n        int16_t * token_count,      // Maximum allowed number of tokens to write\n        int32_t flags               // Optional bitflags.\n    )\n    \n    // Returns match length, or -1 on no match, or -2 on out of memory, or -3 if the regex is invalid.\n    static inline int64_t regex_match(\n        const RegexToken * tokens,  // Parsed regex to match against text.\n        const char * text,          // Text to match against tokens.\n        size_t start_i,             // index value to match at.\n        uint16_t cap_slots,         // Number of allowed capture info output slots.\n        int64_t * cap_pos,          // Capture position info output buffer.\n        int64_t * cap_span          // Capture length info output buffer.\n    ) \n    \n    static inline void print_regex_tokens(\n        RegexToken * tokens     // Regex tokens to spew to stdout, for debugging.\n    )\n\nPERFORMANCE\n\n    On simple cases, Remimu's match speed is similar to PCRE2. Regex parsing/compilation is also much faster (around 4x to 10x), so single-shot regexes are often faster than PCRE2.\n\n    HOWEVER: Remimu is a pure backtracking engine, and has `O(2^x)` complexity on regexes with catastrophic backtracking. It can be much, much, MUCH slower than PCRE2. Beware!\n\n    Remimu uses length-checked fixed memory buffers with no recursion, so memory usage is statically known.\n\nFEATURES\n\n    - Lowest-common-denominator common regex syntax\n    - Based on backtracking (slow in the worst case, but fast in the best case)\n    - 8-bit only, not unicode\n    - Statically known memory usage (no heap allocation or recursion)\n    - Groups with or without capture, and with or without quantifiers\n    - Supported escapes:\n    - - 2-digit hex: e.g. \\x00, \\xFF, or lowercase, or mixed case\n    - - \\r, \\n, \\t, \\v, \\f (whitespace characters)\n    - - \\d, \\s, \\w, \\D, \\S, \\W (digit, space, and word character classes)\n    - - \\b, \\B word boundary and non-word-boundary anchors (not fully supported in zero-size quantified groups, but even then, usually supported)\n    - - Escaped literal characters: {}[]-()|^$*+?:./\\\n    - - - Escapes work in character classes, except for 'b'\n    - Character classes, including disjoint ranges, proper handling of bare [ and trailing -, etc\n    - - Dot (.) matches all characters, including newlines, unless REMIMU_FLAG_DOT_NO_NEWLINES is passed as a flag to regex_parse\n    - - Dot (.) only matches at most one byte at a time, so matching \\r\\n requires two dots (and not using REMIMU_FLAG_DOT_NO_NEWLINES)\n    - Anchors (^ and $)\n    - - Same support caveats as \\b, \\B apply\n    - Basic quantifiers (*, +, ?)\n    - - Quantifiers are greedy by default.\n    - Explicit quantifiers ({2}, {5}, {5,}, {5,7})\n    - Alternation e.g. (asdf|foo)\n    - Lazy quantifiers e.g. (asdf)*? or \\w+?\n    - Possessive greedy quantifiers e.g. (asdf)*+ or \\w++\n    - - NOTE: Capture groups for and inside of possessive groups return no capture information.\n    - Atomic groups e.g. (?>(asdf))\n    - - NOTE: Capture groups inside of atomic groups return no capture information.\n\nNOT SUPPORTED\n\n    - Strings with non-terminal null characters\n    - Unicode, unicode character classes, etc\n    - Exact POSIX regex semantics (posix-style greediness etc)\n    - Backreferences\n    - Lookbehind/Lookahead\n    - Named groups\n    - Most other weird flavor-specific regex stuff\n    - Capture of or inside of possessive-quantified groups (still take up a capture slot, but no data is returned)\n\nUSAGE\n\n    // minimal:\n    \n    RegexToken tokens[1024];\n    int16_t token_count = 1024;\n    int e = regex_parse(\"[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+\", tokens, &token_count, 0);\n    assert(!e);\n    \n    int64_t match_len = regex_match(tokens, \"23.53) \", 0, 0, 0, 0);\n    printf(\"########### return: %zd\\n\", match_len);\n    \n    // with captures:\n    \n    RegexToken tokens[256];\n    int16_t token_count = sizeof(tokens)/sizeof(tokens[0]);\n    int e = regex_parse(\"((a)|(b))++\", tokens, &token_count, 0);\n    assert(!e);\n    \n    int64_t cap_pos[5];\n    int64_t cap_span[5];\n    memset(cap_pos, 0xFF, sizeof(cap_pos));\n    memset(cap_span, 0xFF, sizeof(cap_span));\n    \n    int64_t matchlen = regex_match(tokens, \"aaaaaabbbabaqa\", 0, 5, cap_pos, cap_span);\n    printf(\"Match length: %zd\\n\", matchlen);\n    for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++)\n        printf(\"Capture %d: %zd plus %zd\\n\", i, cap_pos[i], cap_span[i]);\n    \n    // for debugging\n    print_regex_tokens(tokens);\n\nLICENSE\n\n    Creative Commons Zero, public domain.\n\n*/\n\n#include <stdint.h>\n#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stddef.h>\n#include <string.h>\n#include <assert.h>\n\nstatic const int REMIMU_FLAG_DOT_NO_NEWLINES = 1;\n\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_NORMAL      = 0;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_OPEN        = 1;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN      = 2;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE       = 3;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_OR          = 4;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_CARET       = 5;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_DOLLAR      = 6;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_BOUND       = 7;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_NBOUND      = 8;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_KIND_END         = 9;\n\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE  = 1;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_MODE_LAZY        = 2;\nstatic const uint8_t REMIMU_MODE_INVERTED    = 128; // temporary; gets cleared later\n\ntypedef struct _RegexToken {\n    uint8_t kind;\n    uint8_t mode;\n    uint16_t count_lo;\n    uint16_t count_hi; // 0 means no limit\n    uint16_t mask[16]; // for groups: mask 0 stores group-with-quantifier number (quantifiers are +, *, ?, {n}, {n,}, or {n,m})\n    int16_t pair_offset; // from ( or ), offset in token list to matching paren. TODO: move into mask maybe\n} RegexToken;\n\n/// Returns a negative number on failure:\n/// -1: Regex string is invalid or using unsupported features or too long.\n/// -2: Provided buffer not long enough. Give up, or reallocate with more length and retry.\n/// Returns 0 on success.\n/// On call, token_count pointer must point to the number of tokens that can be written to the tokens buffer.\n/// On successful return, the number of actually used tokens is written to token_count.\n/// Sets token_count to zero if a regex is not created but no error happened (e.g. empty pattern).\n/// Flags: Not yet used.\n/// SAFETY: Pattern must be null-terminated.\n/// SAFETY: tokens buffer must have at least the input token_count number of RegexToken objects. They are allowed to be uninitialized.\nstatic inline int regex_parse(const char * pattern, RegexToken * tokens, int16_t * token_count, int32_t flags)\n{\n    int64_t tokens_len = *token_count;\n    uint64_t pattern_len = strlen(pattern);\n    if (token_count == 0)\n        return -2;\n    \n    // 0: normal\n    // 1: just saw a backslash\n    int esc_state = 0;\n    \n    // 0: init\n    // 1: normal\n    // 2: in char class, initial state\n    // 3: in char class, but possibly looking for a range marker\n    // 4: in char class, but just saw a range marker\n    // 5: immediately after quantifiable token\n    // 6: immediately after quantifier\n    \n    const int STATE_NORMAL    = 1;\n    const int STATE_QUANT     = 2;\n    const int STATE_MODE      = 3;\n    const int STATE_CC_INIT   = 4;\n    const int STATE_CC_NORMAL = 5;\n    const int STATE_CC_RANGE  = 6;\n    int state = STATE_NORMAL;\n    \n    int char_class_mem = -1;\n    \n    RegexToken token;\n    #define _REGEX_CLEAR_TOKEN(TOKEN) { memset(&(TOKEN), 0, sizeof(RegexToken)); token.count_lo = 1; token.count_hi = 2; }\n    _REGEX_CLEAR_TOKEN(token);\n    \n    #define _REGEX_DO_INVERT() { \\\n        for (int n = 0; n < 16; n++) \\\n            token.mask[n] = ~token.mask[n]; \\\n        token.mode &= ~REMIMU_MODE_INVERTED; \\\n    }\n    \n    int16_t k = 0;\n    \n    #define _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN() { \\\n        if (k == 0 || tokens[k-1].kind != token.kind || (token.kind != REMIMU_KIND_BOUND && token.kind != REMIMU_KIND_NBOUND)) \\\n        { \\\n            if (token.mode & REMIMU_MODE_INVERTED) _REGEX_DO_INVERT() \\\n            if (k >= tokens_len) \\\n            { \\\n                puts(\"buffer overflow\"); \\\n                return -2; \\\n            } \\\n            tokens[k++] = token; \\\n            _REGEX_CLEAR_TOKEN(token); \\\n        } \\\n    }\n    \n    #define _REGEX_SET_MASK(byte) { token.mask[((uint8_t)(byte))>>4] |= 1 << ((uint8_t)(byte) & 0xF); }\n    #define _REGEX_SET_MASK_ALL() { \\\n        for (int n = 0; n < 16; n++) \\\n            token.mask[n] = 0xFFFF; \\\n    }\n    \n    // start with an invisible group specifier\n    // (this allows the matcher to not need to have a special root-level alternation operator case)\n    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_OPEN;\n    token.count_lo = 0;\n    token.count_hi = 0;\n\n    int paren_count = 0;\n    \n    for (uint64_t i = 0; i < pattern_len; i++)\n    {\n        char c = pattern[i];\n        if (state == STATE_QUANT)\n        {\n            state = STATE_MODE;\n            if (c == '?')\n            {\n                token.count_lo = 0;\n                token.count_hi = 2; // first non-allowed amount\n                continue;\n            }\n            else if (c == '+')\n            {\n                token.count_lo = 1;\n                token.count_hi = 0; // unlimited\n                continue;\n            }\n            else if (c == '*')\n            {\n                token.count_lo = 0;\n                token.count_hi = 0; // unlimited\n                continue;\n            }\n            else if (c == '{')\n            {\n                if (pattern[i+1] == 0 || pattern[i+1] < '0' || pattern[i+1] > '9')\n                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n                else\n                {\n                    i += 1;\n                    uint32_t val = 0;\n                    while (pattern[i] >= '0' && pattern[i] <= '9')\n                    {\n                        val *= 10;\n                        val += (uint32_t)(pattern[i] - '0');\n                        if (val > 0xFFFF)\n                        {\n                            puts(\"quantifier range too long\");\n                            return -1; // unsupported length\n                        }\n                        i += 1;\n                    }\n                    token.count_lo = val;\n                    token.count_hi = val + 1;\n                    if (pattern[i] == ',')\n                    {\n                        token.count_hi = 0; // unlimited\n                        i += 1;\n                        \n                        if (pattern[i] >= '0' && pattern[i] <= '9')\n                        {\n                            uint32_t val2 = 0;\n                            while (pattern[i] >= '0' && pattern[i] <= '9')\n                            {\n                                val2 *= 10;\n                                val2 += (uint32_t)(pattern[i] - '0');\n                                if (val2 > 0xFFFF)\n                                {\n                                    puts(\"quantifier range too long\");\n                                    return -1; // unsupported length\n                                }\n                                i += 1;\n                            }\n                            if (val2 < val)\n                            {\n                                puts(\"quantifier range is backwards\");\n                                return -1; // unsupported length\n                            }\n                            token.count_hi = val2 + 1;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    \n                    if (pattern[i] == '}')\n                    {\n                        // quantifier range parsed successfully\n                        continue;\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        puts(\"quantifier range syntax broken (no terminator)\");\n                        return -1;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        if (state == STATE_MODE)\n        {\n            state = STATE_NORMAL;\n            if (c == '?')\n            {\n                token.mode |= REMIMU_MODE_LAZY;\n                continue;\n            }\n            else if (c == '+')\n            {\n                token.mode |= REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE;\n                continue;\n            }\n        }\n        \n        if (state == STATE_NORMAL)\n        {\n            if (esc_state == 1)\n            {\n                esc_state = 0;\n                if (c == 'n')\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\n')\n                else if (c == 'r')\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\r')\n                else if (c == 't')\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\t')\n                else if (c == 'v')\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\v')\n                else if (c == 'f')\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('\\f')\n                else if (c == 'x')\n                {\n                    if (pattern[i+1] == 0 || pattern[i+2] == 0)\n                        return -1; // too-short hex pattern\n                    uint8_t n0 = pattern[i+1];\n                    uint8_t n1 = pattern[i+1];\n                    if (n0 < '0' || n0 > 'f' || n1 < '0' || n1 > 'f' ||\n                        (n0 > '9' && n0 < 'A') || (n1 > '9' && n1 < 'A'))\n                        return -1; // invalid hex digit\n                    if (n0 > 'F') n0 -= 0x20;\n                    if (n1 > 'F') n1 -= 0x20;\n                    if (n0 >= 'A') n0 -= 'A' - 10;\n                    if (n1 >= 'A') n1 -= 'A' - 10;\n                    n0 -= '0';\n                    n1 -= '0';\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK((n1 << 4) | n0)\n                    i += 2;\n                }\n                else if (c == '{' || c == '}' ||\n                         c == '[' || c == ']' || c == '-' ||\n                         c == '(' || c == ')' ||\n                         c == '|' || c == '^' || c == '$' ||\n                         c == '*' || c == '+' || c == '?' || c == ':' ||\n                         c == '.' || c == '/' || c == '\\\\')\n                {\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK(c)\n                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n                }\n                else if (c == 'd' || c == 's' || c == 'w' ||\n                         c == 'D' || c == 'S' || c == 'W')\n                {\n                    uint8_t is_upper = c <= 'Z';\n                    \n                    uint16_t m[16];\n                    memset(m, 0, sizeof(m));\n                    \n                    if (is_upper)\n                        c += 0x20;\n                    if (c == 'd' || c == 'w')\n                        m[3] |= 0x03FF; // 0~7\n                    if (c == 's')\n                    {\n                        m[0] |= 0x3E00; // \\t-\\r (includes \\n, \\v, and \\f in the middle. 5 enabled bits.)\n                        m[2] |= 1; // ' '\n                    }\n                    if (c == 'w')\n                    {\n                        m[4] |= 0xFFFE; // A-O\n                        m[5] |= 0x87FF; // P-Z_\n                        m[6] |= 0xFFFE; // a-o\n                        m[7] |= 0x07FF; // p-z\n                    }\n                    \n                    for (int i = 0; i < 16; i++)\n                        token.mask[i] |= is_upper ? ~m[i] : m[i];\n                    \n                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NORMAL;\n                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n                }\n                else if (c == 'b')\n                {\n                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_BOUND;\n                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n                }\n                else if (c == 'B')\n                {\n                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NBOUND;\n                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    puts(\"unsupported escape sequence\");\n                    return -1; // unknown/unsupported escape sequence\n                }\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN()\n                if (c == '\\\\')\n                {\n                    esc_state = 1;\n                }\n                else if (c == '[')\n                {\n                    state = STATE_CC_INIT;\n                    char_class_mem = -1;\n                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NORMAL;\n                    if (pattern[i + 1] == '^')\n                    {\n                        token.mode |= REMIMU_MODE_INVERTED;\n                        i += 1;\n                    }\n                }\n                else if (c == '(')\n                {\n                    paren_count += 1;\n                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_OPEN;\n                    token.count_lo = 0;\n                    token.count_hi = 1;\n                    if (pattern[i + 1] == '?' && pattern[i + 2] == ':')\n                    {\n                        token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN;\n                        i += 2;\n                    }\n                    else if (pattern[i + 1] == '?' && pattern[i + 2] == '>')\n                    {\n                        token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN;\n                        _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN()\n                        \n                        state = STATE_NORMAL;\n                        token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN;\n                        token.mode = REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE;\n                        token.count_lo = 1;\n                        token.count_hi = 2;\n                        \n                        i += 2;\n                    }\n                }\n                else if (c == ')')\n                {\n                    paren_count -= 1;\n                    if (paren_count < 0 || k == 0)\n                        return -1; // unbalanced parens\n                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE;\n                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n                    \n                    int balance = 0;\n                    ptrdiff_t found = -1;\n                    for (ptrdiff_t l = k - 1; l >= 0; l--)\n                    {\n                        if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN || tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN)\n                        {\n                            if (balance == 0)\n                            {\n                                found = l;\n                                break;\n                            }\n                            else\n                                balance -= 1;\n                        }\n                        else if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n                            balance += 1;\n                    }\n                    if (found == -1)\n                        return -1; // unbalanced parens\n                    ptrdiff_t diff = k - found;\n                    if (diff > 32767)\n                        return -1; // too long\n                    token.pair_offset = -diff;\n                    tokens[found].pair_offset = diff;\n                    // phantom group for atomic group emulation\n                    if (tokens[found].mode == REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE)\n                    {\n                        _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN()\n                        token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE;\n                        token.mode = REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE;\n                        token.pair_offset = -diff - 2;\n                        tokens[found - 1].pair_offset = diff + 2;\n                    }\n                }\n                else if (c == '?' || c == '+' || c == '*' || c == '{')\n                {\n                    puts(\"quantifier in non-quantifier context\");\n                    return -1; // quantifier in non-quantifier context\n                }\n                else if (c == '.')\n                {\n                    //puts(\"setting ALL of mask...\");\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK_ALL();\n                    if (flags & REMIMU_FLAG_DOT_NO_NEWLINES)\n                    {\n                        token.mask[1] ^= 0x04; // \\n\n                        token.mask[1] ^= 0x20; // \\r\n                    }\n                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n                }\n                else if (c == '^')\n                {\n                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_CARET;\n                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n                }\n                else if (c == '$')\n                {\n                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_DOLLAR;\n                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n                }\n                else if (c == '|')\n                {\n                    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_OR;\n                    state = STATE_NORMAL;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK(c);\n                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        else if (state == STATE_CC_INIT || state == STATE_CC_NORMAL || state == STATE_CC_RANGE)\n        {\n            if (c == '\\\\' && esc_state == 0)\n            {\n                esc_state = 1;\n                continue;\n            }\n            uint8_t esc_c = 0;\n            if (esc_state == 1)\n            {\n                esc_state = 0;\n                if (c == 'n')\n                    esc_c = '\\n';\n                else if (c == 'r')\n                    esc_c = '\\r';\n                else if (c == 't')\n                    esc_c = '\\t';\n                else if (c == 'v')\n                    esc_c = '\\v';\n                else if (c == 'f')\n                    esc_c = '\\f';\n                else if (c == 'x')\n                {\n                    if (pattern[i+1] == 0 || pattern[i+2] == 0)\n                        return -1; // too-short hex pattern\n                    uint8_t n0 = pattern[i+1];\n                    uint8_t n1 = pattern[i+1];\n                    if (n0 < '0' || n0 > 'f' || n1 < '0' || n1 > 'f' ||\n                        (n0 > '9' && n0 < 'A') || (n1 > '9' && n1 < 'A'))\n                        return -1; // invalid hex digit\n                    if (n0 > 'F') n0 -= 0x20;\n                    if (n1 > 'F') n1 -= 0x20;\n                    if (n0 >= 'A') n0 -= 'A' - 10;\n                    if (n1 >= 'A') n1 -= 'A' - 10;\n                    n0 -= '0';\n                    n1 -= '0';\n                    esc_c = (n1 << 4) | n0;\n                    i += 2;\n                }\n                else if (c == '{' || c == '}' ||\n                         c == '[' || c == ']' || c == '-' ||\n                         c == '(' || c == ')' ||\n                         c == '|' || c == '^' || c == '$' ||\n                         c == '*' || c == '+' || c == '?' || c == ':' ||\n                         c == '.' || c == '/' || c == '\\\\')\n                {\n                    esc_c = c;\n                }\n                else if (c == 'd' || c == 's' || c == 'w' ||\n                         c == 'D' || c == 'S' || c == 'W')\n                {\n                    if (state == STATE_CC_RANGE)\n                    {\n                        puts(\"tried to use a shorthand as part of a range\");\n                        return -1; // range shorthands can't be part of a range\n                    }\n                    uint8_t is_upper = c <= 'Z';\n                    \n                    uint16_t m[16];\n                    memset(m, 0, sizeof(m));\n                    \n                    if (is_upper)\n                        c += 0x20;\n                    if (c == 'd' || c == 'w')\n                        m[3] |= 0x03FF; // 0~7\n                    if (c == 's')\n                    {\n                        m[0] |= 0x3E00; // \\t-\\r (includes \\n, \\v, and \\f in the middle. 5 enabled bits.)\n                        m[2] |= 1; // ' '\n                    }\n                    if (c == 'w')\n                    {\n                        m[4] |= 0xFFFE; // A-O\n                        m[5] |= 0x87FF; // P-Z_\n                        m[6] |= 0xFFFE; // a-o\n                        m[7] |= 0x07FF; // p-z\n                    }\n                    \n                    for (int i = 0; i < 16; i++)\n                        token.mask[i] |= is_upper ? ~m[i] : m[i];\n                    \n                    char_class_mem = -1; // range shorthands can't be part of a range\n                    continue;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    printf(\"unknown/unsupported escape sequence in character class (\\\\%c)\\n\", c);\n                    return -1; // unknown/unsupported escape sequence\n                }\n            }\n            if (state == STATE_CC_INIT)\n            {\n                char_class_mem = c;\n                _REGEX_SET_MASK(c);\n                state = STATE_CC_NORMAL;\n            }\n            else if (state == STATE_CC_NORMAL)\n            {\n                if (c == ']' && esc_c == 0)\n                {\n                    char_class_mem = -1;\n                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n                    continue;\n                }\n                else if (c == '-' && esc_c == 0 && char_class_mem >= 0)\n                {\n                    state = STATE_CC_RANGE;\n                    continue;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    char_class_mem = c;\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK(c);\n                    state = STATE_CC_NORMAL;\n                }\n            }\n            else if (state == STATE_CC_RANGE)\n            {\n                if (c == ']' && esc_c == 0)\n                {\n                    char_class_mem = -1;\n                    _REGEX_SET_MASK('-');\n                    state = STATE_QUANT;\n                    continue;\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    if (char_class_mem == -1)\n                    {\n                        puts(\"character class range is broken\");\n                        return -1; // probably tried to use a character class shorthand as part of a range\n                    }\n                    if ((uint8_t)c < char_class_mem)\n                    {\n                        puts(\"character class range is misordered\");\n                        return -1; // range is in wrong order\n                    }\n                    //printf(\"enabling char class from %d to %d...\\n\", char_class_mem, c);\n                    for (uint8_t i = c; i > char_class_mem; i--)\n                        _REGEX_SET_MASK(i);\n                    state = STATE_CC_NORMAL;\n                    char_class_mem = -1;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        else\n            assert(0);\n    }\n    if (paren_count > 0)\n    {\n        puts(\"(paren_count > 0)\");\n        return -1; // unbalanced parens\n    }\n    if (esc_state != 0)\n    {\n        puts(\"(esc_state != 0)\");\n        return -1; // open escape sequence\n    }\n    if (state >= STATE_CC_INIT)\n    {\n        puts(\"(state >= STATE_CC_INIT)\");\n        return -1; // open character class\n    }\n    \n    _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN()\n    \n    // add invisible non-capturing group specifier\n    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE;\n    token.count_lo = 1;\n    token.count_hi = 2;\n    _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN();\n    \n    // add end token (tells matcher that it's done)\n    token.kind = REMIMU_KIND_END;\n    _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN();\n    \n    tokens[0].pair_offset = k - 2;\n    tokens[k-2].pair_offset = -(k - 2);\n    \n    *token_count = k;\n    \n    // copy quantifiers from )s to (s (so (s know whether they're optional)\n    // also take the opportunity to smuggle \"quantified group index\" into the mask field for the )\n    uint64_t n = 0;\n    for (int16_t k2 = 0; k2 < k; k2++)\n    {\n        if (tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n        {\n            tokens[k2].mask[0] = n++;\n            \n            int16_t k3 = k2 + tokens[k2].pair_offset;\n            tokens[k3].count_lo = tokens[k2].count_lo;\n            tokens[k3].count_hi = tokens[k2].count_hi;\n            tokens[k3].mask[0] = n++;\n            tokens[k3].mode = tokens[k2].mode;\n            \n            //if (n > 65535)\n            if (n > 1024)\n                return -1; // too many quantified groups\n        }\n        else if (tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR || tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n        {\n            // find next | or ) and how far away it is. store in token\n            int balance = 0;\n            ptrdiff_t found = -1;\n            for (ptrdiff_t l = k2 + 1; l < tokens_len; l++)\n            {\n                if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR && balance == 0)\n                {\n                    found = l;\n                    break;\n                }\n                else if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n                {\n                    if (balance == 0)\n                    {\n                        found = l;\n                        break;\n                    }\n                    else\n                        balance -= 1;\n                }\n                else if (tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN || tokens[l].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN)\n                    balance += 1;\n            }\n            if (found == -1)\n            {\n                puts(\"unbalanced parens...\");\n                return -1; // unbalanced parens\n            }\n            ptrdiff_t diff = found - k2;\n            if (diff > 32767)\n            {\n                puts(\"too long...\");\n                return -1; // too long\n            }\n            \n            if (tokens[k2].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR)\n                tokens[k2].pair_offset = diff;\n            else\n                tokens[k2].mask[15] = diff;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    #undef _REGEX_PUSH_TOKEN\n    #undef _REGEX_SET_MASK\n    #undef _REGEX_CLEAR_TOKEN\n    \n    return 0;\n}\n\ntypedef struct _RegexMatcherState {\n    uint32_t k;\n    uint32_t group_state; // quantified group temp state (e.g. number of repetitions)\n    uint32_t prev; // for )s, stack index of corresponding previous quantified state\n#ifdef REGEX_STACK_SMOL\n    uint32_t i;\n    uint32_t range_min;\n    uint32_t range_max;\n#else\n    uint64_t i;\n    uint64_t range_min;\n    uint64_t range_max;\n#endif\n} RegexMatcherState;\n\n// NOTE: undef'd later\n#define _REGEX_CHECK_MASK(K, byte) (!!(tokens[K].mask[((uint8_t)byte)>>4] & (1 << ((uint8_t)byte & 0xF))))\n\n// Returns match length if text starts with a regex match.\n// Returns -1 if the text doesn't start with a regex match.\n// Returns -2 if the matcher ran out of memory or the regex is too complex.\n// Returns -3 if the regex is somehow invalid.\n// The first cap_slots capture positions and spans (lengths) will be written to cap_pos and cap_span. If zero, will not be written to.\n// SAFETY: The text variable must be null-terminated, and start_i must be the index of a character within the string or its null terminator.\n// SAFETY: Tokens array must be terminated by a REMIMU_KIND_END token (done by default by regex_parse).\n// SAFETY: Partial capture data may be written even if the match fails.\nstatic inline int64_t regex_match(const RegexToken * tokens, const char * text, size_t start_i, uint16_t cap_slots, int64_t * cap_pos, int64_t * cap_span)\n{\n    (void)text;\n    \n#ifdef REGEX_VERBOSE\n    const uint8_t verbose = 1;\n#else\n    const uint8_t verbose = 0;\n#endif\n    \n#define IF_VERBOSE(X) { if (verbose) { X } }\n    \n#ifdef REGEX_STACK_SMOL\n    const uint16_t stack_size_max = 256;\n#else\n    const uint16_t stack_size_max = 1024;\n#endif\n    const uint16_t aux_stats_size = 1024;\n    if (cap_slots > aux_stats_size)\n        cap_slots = aux_stats_size;\n    \n    // quantified group state\n    uint8_t q_group_accepts_zero[aux_stats_size];\n    uint32_t q_group_state[aux_stats_size]; // number of repetitions\n    uint32_t q_group_stack[aux_stats_size]; // location of most recent corresponding ) on stack. 0 means nowhere\n    \n    uint16_t q_group_cap_index[aux_stats_size];\n    memset(q_group_cap_index, 0xFF, sizeof(q_group_cap_index));\n    \n    uint64_t tokens_len = 0;\n    uint32_t k = 0;\n    uint16_t caps = 0;\n    \n    while (tokens[k].kind != REMIMU_KIND_END)\n    {\n        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN && caps < cap_slots)\n        {\n            q_group_cap_index[tokens[k].mask[0]] = caps;\n            q_group_cap_index[tokens[k + tokens[k].pair_offset].mask[0]] = caps;\n            cap_pos[caps] = -1;\n            cap_span[caps] = -1;\n            caps += 1;\n        }\n        k += 1;\n        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE || tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n        {\n            if (tokens[k].mask[0] >= aux_stats_size)\n            {\n                puts(\"too many qualified groups. returning\");\n                return -2; // OOM: too many quantified groups\n            }\n            \n            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n            q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n            q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    tokens_len = k;\n    \n    RegexMatcherState rewind_stack[stack_size_max];\n    uint16_t stack_n = 0;\n    \n    uint64_t i = start_i;\n    \n    uint64_t range_min = 0;\n    uint64_t range_max = 0;\n    uint8_t just_rewinded = 0;\n    \n    #define _P_TEXT_HIGHLIGHTED() { \\\n        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"\\033[91m\"); \\\n        for (uint64_t q = 0; q < i; q++) printf(\"%c\", text[q]); \\\n        printf(\"\\033[0m\"); \\\n        for (uint64_t q = i; text[q] != 0; q++) printf(\"%c\", text[q]); \\\n        printf(\"\\n\");) \\\n    }\n    \n    #define _REWIND_DO_SAVE_RAW(K, ISDUMMY) { \\\n        if (stack_n >= stack_size_max) \\\n        { \\\n            puts(\"out of backtracking room. returning\"); \\\n            return -2; \\\n        } \\\n        RegexMatcherState s; \\\n        memset(&s, 0, sizeof(RegexMatcherState)); \\\n        s.i = i; \\\n        s.k = (K); \\\n        s.range_min = range_min; \\\n        s.range_max = range_max; \\\n        s.prev = 0; \\\n        if (ISDUMMY) s.prev = 0xFAC7; \\\n        else if (tokens[s.k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE) \\\n        { \\\n            s.group_state = q_group_state[tokens[s.k].mask[0]]; \\\n            s.prev = q_group_stack[tokens[s.k].mask[0]]; \\\n            q_group_stack[tokens[s.k].mask[0]] = stack_n; \\\n        } \\\n        rewind_stack[stack_n++] = s; \\\n        _P_TEXT_HIGHLIGHTED() \\\n        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"-- saving rewind state k %u i %zd rmin %zu rmax %zd (line %d) (depth %d prev %d)\\n\", s.k, i, range_min, range_max, __LINE__, stack_n, s.prev);) \\\n    }\n    #define _REWIND_DO_SAVE_DUMMY(K) _REWIND_DO_SAVE_RAW(K, 1)\n    #define _REWIND_DO_SAVE(K) _REWIND_DO_SAVE_RAW(K, 0)\n    \n    #define _REWIND_OR_ABORT() { \\\n        if (stack_n == 0) \\\n            return -1; \\\n        stack_n -= 1; \\\n        while (stack_n > 0 && rewind_stack[stack_n].prev == 0xFAC7) stack_n -= 1; \\\n        just_rewinded = 1; \\\n        range_min = rewind_stack[stack_n].range_min; \\\n        range_max = rewind_stack[stack_n].range_max; \\\n        assert(rewind_stack[stack_n].i <= i); \\\n        i = rewind_stack[stack_n].i; \\\n        k = rewind_stack[stack_n].k; \\\n        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE) \\\n        { \\\n            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = rewind_stack[stack_n].group_state; \\\n            q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]] = rewind_stack[stack_n].prev; \\\n        } \\\n        _P_TEXT_HIGHLIGHTED() \\\n        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"-- rewound to k %u i %zd rmin %zu rmax %zd (kind %d prev %d)\\n\", k, i, range_min, range_max, tokens[k].kind, rewind_stack[stack_n].prev);) \\\n        k -= 1; \\\n    }\n    // the -= 1 is because of the k++ in the for loop\n    \n    // used in boundary anchor checker\n    uint64_t w_mask[16];\n    memset(w_mask, 0, sizeof(w_mask));\n    w_mask[3] = 0x03FF;\n    w_mask[4] = 0xFFFE;\n    w_mask[5] = 0x87FF;\n    w_mask[6] = 0xFFFE;\n    w_mask[7] = 0x07FF;\n    #define _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(byte) (!!(w_mask[((uint8_t)byte)>>4] & (1 << ((uint8_t)byte & 0xF))))\n    \n    size_t limit = 10000;\n    for (k = 0; k < tokens_len; k++)\n    {\n        //limit--;\n        if (limit == 0)\n        {\n            puts(\"iteration limit exceeded. returning\");\n            return -2;\n        }\n        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"k: %u\\ti: %zu\\tl: %zu\\tstack_n: %d\\n\", k, i, limit, stack_n);)\n        _P_TEXT_HIGHLIGHTED();\n        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CARET)\n        {\n            if (i != 0)\n                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n            continue;\n        }\n        else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_DOLLAR)\n        {\n            if (text[i] != 0)\n                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n            continue;\n        }\n        else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_BOUND)\n        {\n            if (i == 0 && !_REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i]))\n                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n            else if (i != 0 && text[i] == 0 && !_REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i-1]))\n                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n            else if (i != 0 && text[i] != 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i-1]) == _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i]))\n                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n        }\n        else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NBOUND)\n        {\n            if (i == 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i]))\n                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n            else if (i != 0 && text[i] == 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i-1]))\n                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n            else if (i != 0 && text[i] != 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i-1]) != _REGEX_CHECK_IS_W(text[i]))\n                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n        }\n        else\n        {\n            // deliberately unmatchable token (e.g. a{0}, a{0,0})\n            if (tokens[k].count_hi == 1)\n            {\n                if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n                    k += tokens[k].pair_offset;\n                else\n                    k += 1;\n                continue;\n            }\n            \n            if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n            {\n                if (!just_rewinded)\n                {\n                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"hit OPEN. i is %zd, depth is %d\\n\", i, stack_n);)\n                    // need this to be able to detect and reject zero-size matches\n                    //q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = i;\n                    \n                    // if we're lazy and the min length is 0, we need to try the non-group case first\n                    if ((tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY) && (tokens[k].count_lo == 0 || q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k + tokens[k].pair_offset].mask[0]]))\n                    {\n                        IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"trying non-group case first.....\");)\n                        range_min = 0;\n                        range_max = 0;\n                        _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n                        k += tokens[k].pair_offset; // automatic += 1 will put us past the matching )\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        range_min = 1;\n                        range_max = 0;\n                        _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n                    }\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"rewinded into OPEN. i is %zd, depth is %d\\n\", i, stack_n);)\n                    just_rewinded = 0;\n                    \n                    uint64_t orig_k = k;\n                    \n                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"--- trying to try another alternation, start k is %d, rmin is %zu\\n\", k, range_min);)\n                    \n                    if (range_min != 0)\n                    {\n                        IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"rangemin is not zero. checking...\");)\n                        k += range_min;\n                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"start kind: %d\\n\", tokens[k].kind);)\n                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"before start kind: %d\\n\", tokens[k-1].kind);)\n                        if (tokens[k-1].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR)\n                            k += tokens[k-1].pair_offset - 1;\n                        else if (tokens[k-1].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OPEN || tokens[k-1].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NCOPEN)\n                            k += tokens[k-1].mask[15] - 1;\n                        \n                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"kamakama %d %d\\n\", k, tokens[k].kind);)\n                        \n                        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_END) // unbalanced parens\n                            return -3;\n                        \n                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"---?!?!   %d, %d\\n\", k, q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]]);)\n                        if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"!!~!~!~~~~!!~~!~   hit CLOSE. rewinding\");)\n                            // do nothing and continue on if we don't need this group\n                            if (tokens[k].count_lo == 0 || q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]])\n                            {\n                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"continuing because we don't need this group\");)\n                                q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n                                \n                                if (!(tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY))\n                                    q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n                                \n                                continue;\n                            }\n                            // otherwise go to the last point before the group\n                            else\n                            {\n                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"going to last point before this group\");)\n                                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n                                continue;\n                            }\n                        }\n                        \n                        assert(tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR);\n                    }\n                    \n                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"--- FOUND ALTERNATION for paren at k %zd at k %d\\n\", orig_k, k);)\n                    \n                    ptrdiff_t k_diff = k - orig_k;\n                    range_min = k_diff + 1;\n                    \n                    IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"(saving in paren after rewinding and looking for next regex token to check)\");)\n                    IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"%zd\\n\", range_min);)\n                    _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k - k_diff)\n                }\n            }\n            else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_CLOSE)\n            {\n                // unquantified\n                if (tokens[k].count_lo == 1 && tokens[k].count_hi == 2)\n                {\n                    // for captures\n                    uint16_t cap_index = q_group_cap_index[tokens[k].mask[0]];\n                    if (cap_index != 0xFFFF)\n                        _REWIND_DO_SAVE_DUMMY(k)\n                }\n                // quantified\n                else\n                {\n                    IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"closer test.....\");)\n                    if (!just_rewinded)\n                    {\n                        uint32_t prev = q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]];\n                        \n                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"qrqrqrqrqrqrqrq-------      k %d, gs %d, gaz %d, i %zd, tklo %d, rmin %zd, tkhi %d, rmax %zd, prev %d, sn %d\\n\", k, q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]], i, tokens[k].count_lo, range_min, tokens[k].count_hi, range_max, prev, stack_n);)\n                        \n                        range_max = tokens[k].count_hi;\n                        range_max -= 1;\n                        range_min = q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]] ? 0 : tokens[k].count_lo;\n                        //assert(q_group_state[tokens[k + tokens[k].pair_offset].mask[0]] <= i);\n                        //if (prev) assert(rewind_stack[prev].i <= i);\n                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"qzqzqzqzqzqzqzq-------      rmin %zd, rmax %zd\\n\", range_min, range_max);)\n                        \n                        // minimum requirement not yet met\n                        if (q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] + 1 < range_min)\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"continuing minimum matches for a quantified group\");)\n                            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] += 1;\n                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n                            \n                            k += tokens[k].pair_offset; // back to start of group\n                            k -= 1; // ensure we actually hit the group node next and not the node after it\n                            continue;\n                        }\n                        // maximum allowance exceeded\n                        else if (tokens[k].count_hi != 0 && q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] + 1 > range_max)\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"hit maximum allowed instances of a quantified group %d %zd\\n\", q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], range_max);)\n                            range_max -= 1;\n                            _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n                            continue;\n                        }\n                        \n                        // fallback case to detect zero-length matches when we backtracked into the inside of this group\n                        // after an attempted parse of a second copy of itself\n                        uint8_t force_zero = 0;\n                        if (prev != 0 && (uint32_t)rewind_stack[prev].i > (uint32_t)i)\n                        {\n                            // find matching open paren\n                            size_t n = stack_n - 1;\n                            while (n > 0 && rewind_stack[n].k != k + tokens[k].pair_offset)\n                                n -= 1;\n                            assert(n > 0);\n                            if (rewind_stack[n].i == i)\n                                force_zero = 1;\n                        }\n                        \n                        // reject zero-length matches\n                        if ((force_zero || (prev != 0 && (uint32_t)rewind_stack[prev].i == (uint32_t)i))) //  && q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] > 0\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"rejecting zero-length match..... %d %zd %zd\\n\", force_zero, rewind_stack[prev].i, i);)\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"%d (k: %d)\\n\", q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], k);)\n                            \n                            q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 1;\n                            _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n                            //range_max = q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]];\n                            //range_min = 0;\n                        }\n                        else if (tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY) // lazy\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"nidnfasidfnidfndifn-------      %d, %d, %zd\\n\", q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], tokens[k].count_lo, range_min);)\n                            if (prev)\n                                IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"lazy doesn't think it's zero-length. prev i %zd vs i %zd (depth %d)\\n\", rewind_stack[prev].i, i, stack_n);)\n                            // continue on to past the group; group retry is in rewind state\n                            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] += 1;\n                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n                            q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n                        }\n                        else // greedy\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"wahiwahi\");)\n                            // clear unwanted memory if possessive\n                            if ((tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE))\n                            {\n                                uint32_t k2 = k;\n                                \n                                // special case for first, only rewind to (, not to )\n                                if (q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] == 0)\n                                    k2 = k + tokens[k].pair_offset;\n                                \n                                if (stack_n == 0)\n                                    return -1;\n                                stack_n -= 1;\n                                \n                                while (stack_n > 0 && rewind_stack[stack_n].k != k2)\n                                    stack_n -= 1;\n                                \n                                if (stack_n == 0)\n                                    return -1;\n                            }\n                            // continue to next match if sane\n                            if ((uint32_t)q_group_state[tokens[k + tokens[k].pair_offset].mask[0]] < (uint32_t)i)\n                            {\n                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"REWINDING FROM GREEDY NON-REWIND CLOSER\");)\n                                q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] += 1;\n                                _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n                                k += tokens[k].pair_offset; // back to start of group\n                                k -= 1; // ensure we actually hit the group node next and not the node after it\n                            }\n                            else\n                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"CONTINUING FROM GREEDY NON-REWIND CLOSER\");)\n                        }\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"IN CLOSER REWIND!!!\");)\n                        just_rewinded = 0;\n                        \n                        if (tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY)\n                        {\n                            // lazy rewind: need to try matching the group again\n                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE_DUMMY(k)\n                            q_group_stack[tokens[k].mask[0]] = stack_n;\n                            k += tokens[k].pair_offset; // back to start of group\n                            k -= 1; // ensure we actually hit the group node next and not the node after it\n                        }\n                        else\n                        {\n                            // greedy. if we're going to go outside the acceptable range, rewind\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"kufukufu %d %zd\\n\", tokens[k].count_lo, range_min);)\n                            //uint64_t old_i = i;\n                            if (q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] < range_min && !q_group_accepts_zero[tokens[k].mask[0]])\n                            {\n                                IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"rewinding from greedy group because we're going to go out of range (%d vs %zd)\\n\", q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]], range_min);)\n                                //i = old_i;\n                                _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n                            }\n                            // otherwise continue on to past the group\n                            else\n                            {\n                                IF_VERBOSE(puts(\"continuing past greedy group\");)\n                                q_group_state[tokens[k].mask[0]] = 0;\n                                \n                                // for captures\n                                uint16_t cap_index = q_group_cap_index[tokens[k].mask[0]];\n                                if (cap_index != 0xFFFF)\n                                    _REWIND_DO_SAVE_DUMMY(k)\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_OR)\n            {\n                IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"hit OR at %d. adding %d\\n\", k, tokens[k].pair_offset);)\n                k += tokens[k].pair_offset;\n                k -= 1;\n            }\n            else if (tokens[k].kind == REMIMU_KIND_NORMAL)\n            {\n                if (!just_rewinded)\n                {\n                    uint64_t n = 0;\n                    // do whatever the obligatory minimum amount of matching is\n                    uint64_t old_i = i;\n                    while (n < tokens[k].count_lo && text[i] != 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_MASK(k, text[i]))\n                    {\n                        i += 1;\n                        n += 1;\n                    }\n                    if (n < tokens[k].count_lo)\n                    {\n                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"non-match A. rewinding (token %d)\\n\", k);)\n                        i = old_i;\n                        _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n                        continue;\n                    }\n                    \n                    if (tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY)\n                    {\n                        range_min = n;\n                        range_max = tokens[k].count_hi - 1;\n                        _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        uint64_t limit = tokens[k].count_hi;\n                        if (limit == 0)\n                            limit = ~limit;\n                        range_min = n;\n                        while (text[i] != 0 && _REGEX_CHECK_MASK(k, text[i]) && n + 1 < limit)\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"match!! (%c)\\n\", text[i]);)\n                            i += 1;\n                            n += 1;\n                        }\n                        range_max = n;\n                        IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"set rmin to %zd and rmax to %zd on entry into normal greedy token with k %d\\n\", range_min, range_max, k);)\n                        if (!(tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_POSSESSIVE))\n                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n                    }\n                }\n                else\n                {\n                    just_rewinded = 0;\n                    \n                    if (tokens[k].mode & REMIMU_MODE_LAZY)\n                    {\n                        uint64_t limit = range_max;\n                        if (limit == 0)\n                            limit = ~limit;\n                        \n                        if (_REGEX_CHECK_MASK(k, text[i]) && text[i] != 0 && range_min < limit)\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"match2!! (%c) (k: %d)\\n\", text[i], k);)\n                            i += 1;\n                            range_min += 1;\n                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n                        }\n                        else\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"core rewind lazy (k: %d)\\n\", k);)\n                            _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n                        }\n                    }\n                    else\n                    {\n                        //IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"comparing rmin %zd and rmax %zd token with k %d\\n\", range_min, range_max, k);)\n                        if (range_max > range_min)\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"greedy normal going back (k: %d)\\n\", k);)\n                            i -= 1;\n                            range_max -= 1;\n                            _REWIND_DO_SAVE(k)\n                        }\n                        else\n                        {\n                            IF_VERBOSE(printf(\"core rewind greedy (k: %d)\\n\", k);)\n                            _REWIND_OR_ABORT()\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                fprintf(stderr, \"unimplemented token kind %d\\n\", tokens[k].kind);\n                assert(0);\n            }\n        }\n        //printf(\"k... %d\\n\", k);\n    }\n    \n    if (caps != 0)\n    {\n        //printf(\"stack_n: %d\\n\", stack_n);\n        fflush(stdout);\n        for (size_t n = 0; n < stack_n; n++)\n        {\n            RegexMatcherState s = rewind_stack[n];\n            int kind = tokens[s.k].kind;\n            if (kind == R